#: /cfcore_ui/Widgets/UI_ExpandedModSlot.UI_ExpandedModSlot_C:WidgetTree.TEXT_ModSummary.Text
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,649767824"
msgid "This mod introduces a thoughtfully designed expansion to your base experience, adding fresh features, mechanics, and improvements that blend seamlessly with the original content. Whether you're looking to deepen gameplay systems, enrich your world, or simply add more variety and depth, this mod serves as a flexible foundation for countless playstyles.\r\n\r\nI got no idea who wrote this. I copied it from the design docs. It's impressive, isn't it? So here I am copy pasting it. Actually i need a much longer placeholder text to test how text scales and if it clips if we run out of space. Honestly I'll add a scale box just in case to be futureproof. What else to write to make the text longer. I should have used ipsom but my internet doesn't work right now to search something and copy it. Anyway, whoever is reading this, hope you have a good day and your coffee be the tastiest it ever been."
msgstr "This mod introduces a thoughtfully designed expansion to your base experience, adding fresh features, mechanics, and improvements that blend seamlessly with the original content. Whether you're looking to deepen gameplay systems, enrich your world, or simply add more variety and depth, this mod serves as a flexible foundation for countless playstyles.\r\n\r\nI got no idea who wrote this. I copied it from the design docs. It's impressive, isn't it? So here I am copy pasting it. Actually i need a much longer placeholder text to test how text scales and if it clips if we run out of space. Honestly I'll add a scale box just in case to be futureproof. What else to write to make the text longer. I should have used ipsom but my internet doesn't work right now to search something and copy it. Anyway, whoever is reading this, hope you have a good day and your coffee be the tastiest it ever been."

