msgstr "Auto-Exposure maximum adaptation. Eye Adaptation is disabled if Min = Max.\nAuto-exposure is implemented by choosing an exposure value for which the average luminance generates a pixel brightness equal to the Constant Calibration value.\nThe Min/Max are expressed in pixel luminance (cd/m2) or in EV100 when using ExtendDefaultLuminanceRange (see project settings)."

