msgstr "Adjusts indirect lighting color. (1,1,1) is default. (0,0,0) to disable GI. The show flag 'Global Illumination' must be enabled to use this property."

#. Key:	1164822090
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ASA/Dinos/Megaraptor/Abilities/Buff_ExIsolatedDamage.UpdateGlobalDepthOfField:K2Node_SetFieldsInStruct_1.ShowPinForProperties(68).ShowPinForProperties.PropertyTooltip
#: /Game/ASA/Dinos/Megaraptor/Abilities/Buff_ExIsolatedDamage.UpdateGlobalDepthOfField:K2Node_SetFieldsInStruct_1.ShowPinForProperties(68).ShowPinForProperties.PropertyTooltip
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,1164822090"
msgid "Scales the indirect lighting contribution. A value of 0 disables GI. Default is 1. The show flag 'Global Illumination' must be enabled to use this property."
msgstr "Scales the indirect lighting contribution. A value of 0 disables GI. Default is 1. The show flag 'Global Illumination' must be enabled to use this property."

#. Key:	3103739109
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ASA/Dinos/Megaraptor/Abilities/Buff_ExIsolatedDamage.UpdateGlobalDepthOfField:K2Node_SetFieldsInStruct_1.ShowPinForProperties(69).ShowPinForProperties.PropertyTooltip
#: /Game/ASA/Dinos/Megaraptor/Abilities/Buff_ExIsolatedDamage.UpdateGlobalDepthOfField:K2Node_SetFieldsInStruct_1.ShowPinForProperties(69).ShowPinForProperties.PropertyTooltip
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,3103739109"
msgid "Controls how Lumen rays are lit when Lumen is using Hardware Ray Tracing.  By default, Lumen uses the Surface Cache for best performance, but can be set to 'Hit Lighting' for higher quality."
msgstr "Controls how Lumen rays are lit when Lumen is using Hardware Ray Tracing.  By default, Lumen uses the Surface Cache for best performance, but can be set to 'Hit Lighting' for higher quality."

#. Key:	3517872884
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ASA/Dinos/Megaraptor/Abilities/Buff_ExIsolatedDamage.UpdateGlobalDepthOfField:K2Node_SetFieldsInStruct_1.ShowPinForProperties(7).ShowPinForProperties.PropertyTooltip
#: /Game/ASA/Dinos/Megaraptor/Abilities/Buff_ExIsolatedDamage.UpdateGlobalDepthOfField:K2Node_SetFieldsInStruct_1.ShowPinForProperties(7).ShowPinForProperties.PropertyTooltip
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,3517872884"
msgid "Control the range of light and dark values in your scene. Lower values will reduce the difference between bright and dark areas while higher values will increase the difference between the bright and dark areas."
msgstr "Control the range of light and dark values in your scene. Lower values will reduce the difference between bright and dark areas while higher values will increase the difference between the bright and dark areas."

#. Key:	17895865
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ASA/Dinos/Megaraptor/Abilities/Buff_ExIsolatedDamage.UpdateGlobalDepthOfField:K2Node_SetFieldsInStruct_1.ShowPinForProperties(70).ShowPinForProperties.PropertyTooltip
#: /Game/ASA/Dinos/Megaraptor/Abilities/Buff_ExIsolatedDamage.UpdateGlobalDepthOfField:K2Node_SetFieldsInStruct_1.ShowPinForProperties(70).ShowPinForProperties.PropertyTooltip
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,17895865"
msgid "Scales Lumen Scene's quality.  Larger scales cause Lumen Scene to be calculated with a higher fidelity, which can be visible in reflections, but increase GPU cost."
msgstr "Scales Lumen Scene's quality.  Larger scales cause Lumen Scene to be calculated with a higher fidelity, which can be visible in reflections, but increase GPU cost."

#. Key:	1912932293
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ASA/Dinos/Megaraptor/Abilities/Buff_ExIsolatedDamage.UpdateGlobalDepthOfField:K2Node_SetFieldsInStruct_1.ShowPinForProperties(71).ShowPinForProperties.PropertyTooltip
#: /Game/ASA/Dinos/Megaraptor/Abilities/Buff_ExIsolatedDamage.UpdateGlobalDepthOfField:K2Node_SetFieldsInStruct_1.ShowPinForProperties(71).ShowPinForProperties.PropertyTooltip
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,1912932293"
msgid "Controls the size of instances that can be represented in Lumen Scene.  Larger values will ensure small objects are represented, but increase GPU cost."
msgstr "Controls the size of instances that can be represented in Lumen Scene.  Larger values will ensure small objects are represented, but increase GPU cost."

#. Key:	1747456416
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ASA/Dinos/Megaraptor/Abilities/Buff_ExIsolatedDamage.UpdateGlobalDepthOfField:K2Node_SetFieldsInStruct_1.ShowPinForProperties(72).ShowPinForProperties.PropertyTooltip
#: /Game/ASA/Dinos/Megaraptor/Abilities/Buff_ExIsolatedDamage.UpdateGlobalDepthOfField:K2Node_SetFieldsInStruct_1.ShowPinForProperties(72).ShowPinForProperties.PropertyTooltip
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,1747456416"
msgid "Sets the maximum view distance of the scene that Lumen maintains for ray tracing against.  Larger values will increase the effective range of sky shadowing and Global Illumination, but increase GPU cost."
msgstr "Sets the maximum view distance of the scene that Lumen maintains for ray tracing against.  Larger values will increase the effective range of sky shadowing and Global Illumination, but increase GPU cost."

#. Key:	4057591098
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ASA/Dinos/Megaraptor/Abilities/Buff_ExIsolatedDamage.UpdateGlobalDepthOfField:K2Node_SetFieldsInStruct_1.ShowPinForProperties(73).ShowPinForProperties.PropertyTooltip
#: /Game/ASA/Dinos/Megaraptor/Abilities/Buff_ExIsolatedDamage.UpdateGlobalDepthOfField:K2Node_SetFieldsInStruct_1.ShowPinForProperties(73).ShowPinForProperties.PropertyTooltip
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,4057591098"
msgid "Controls how much Lumen Scene is allowed to cache lighting results to improve performance.  Larger scales cause lighting changes to propagate faster, but increase GPU cost."
msgstr "Controls how much Lumen Scene is allowed to cache lighting results to improve performance.  Larger scales cause lighting changes to propagate faster, but increase GPU cost."

#. Key:	2542575513
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ASA/Dinos/Megaraptor/Abilities/Buff_ExIsolatedDamage.UpdateGlobalDepthOfField:K2Node_SetFieldsInStruct_1.ShowPinForProperties(74).ShowPinForProperties.PropertyTooltip
#: /Game/ASA/Dinos/Megaraptor/Abilities/Buff_ExIsolatedDamage.UpdateGlobalDepthOfField:K2Node_SetFieldsInStruct_1.ShowPinForProperties(74).ShowPinForProperties.PropertyTooltip
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,2542575513"
msgid "Scales Lumen's Final Gather quality.  Larger scales reduce noise, but greatly increase GPU cost."
msgstr "Scales Lumen's Final Gather quality.  Larger scales reduce noise, but greatly increase GPU cost."

#. Key:	1936397212
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ASA/Dinos/Megaraptor/Abilities/Buff_ExIsolatedDamage.UpdateGlobalDepthOfField:K2Node_SetFieldsInStruct_1.ShowPinForProperties(75).ShowPinForProperties.PropertyTooltip
#: /Game/ASA/Dinos/Megaraptor/Abilities/Buff_ExIsolatedDamage.UpdateGlobalDepthOfField:K2Node_SetFieldsInStruct_1.ShowPinForProperties(75).ShowPinForProperties.PropertyTooltip
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,1936397212"
msgid "Controls how much Lumen Final Gather is allowed to cache lighting results to improve performance.  Larger scales cause lighting changes to propagate faster, but increase GPU cost and noise."
msgstr "Controls how much Lumen Final Gather is allowed to cache lighting results to improve performance.  Larger scales cause lighting changes to propagate faster, but increase GPU cost and noise."

#. Key:	2956540998
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ASA/Dinos/Megaraptor/Abilities/Buff_ExIsolatedDamage.UpdateGlobalDepthOfField:K2Node_SetFieldsInStruct_1.ShowPinForProperties(76).ShowPinForProperties.PropertyTooltip
#: /Game/ASA/Dinos/Megaraptor/Abilities/Buff_ExIsolatedDamage.UpdateGlobalDepthOfField:K2Node_SetFieldsInStruct_1.ShowPinForProperties(76).ShowPinForProperties.PropertyTooltip
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,2956540998"
msgid "Whether to use screen space traces for Lumen Global Illumination. Screen space traces bypass Lumen Scene and instead sample Scene Depth and Scene Color. This improves quality, as it bypasses Lumen Scene, but causes view dependent lighting."
msgstr "Whether to use screen space traces for Lumen Global Illumination. Screen space traces bypass Lumen Scene and instead sample Scene Depth and Scene Color. This improves quality, as it bypasses Lumen Scene, but causes view dependent lighting."

#. Key:	3581629176
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ASA/Dinos/Megaraptor/Abilities/Buff_ExIsolatedDamage.UpdateGlobalDepthOfField:K2Node_SetFieldsInStruct_1.ShowPinForProperties(77).ShowPinForProperties.PropertyTooltip
#: /Game/ASA/Dinos/Megaraptor/Abilities/Buff_ExIsolatedDamage.UpdateGlobalDepthOfField:K2Node_SetFieldsInStruct_1.ShowPinForProperties(77).ShowPinForProperties.PropertyTooltip
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,3581629176"
msgid "Controls the maximum distance that Lumen should trace while solving lighting.  Values that are too small will cause lighting to leak into large caves, while values that are large will increase GPU cost."
msgstr "Controls the maximum distance that Lumen should trace while solving lighting.  Values that are too small will cause lighting to leak into large caves, while values that are large will increase GPU cost."

#. Key:	2858051560
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ASA/Dinos/Megaraptor/Abilities/Buff_ExIsolatedDamage.UpdateGlobalDepthOfField:K2Node_SetFieldsInStruct_1.ShowPinForProperties(78).ShowPinForProperties.PropertyTooltip
#: /Game/ASA/Dinos/Megaraptor/Abilities/Buff_ExIsolatedDamage.UpdateGlobalDepthOfField:K2Node_SetFieldsInStruct_1.ShowPinForProperties(78).ShowPinForProperties.PropertyTooltip
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,2858051560"
msgid "Allows brightening indirect lighting by calculating material diffuse color for indirect lighting as pow(DiffuseColor, 1 / DiffuseColorBoost). Values above 1 (original diffuse color) aren't physically correct, but they can be useful as an art direction knob to increase the amount of bounced light in the scene. Best to keep below 2 as it also causes reflections to be brighter than the scene."
msgstr "Allows brightening indirect lighting by calculating material diffuse color for indirect lighting as pow(DiffuseColor, 1 / DiffuseColorBoost). Values above 1 (original diffuse color) aren't physically correct, but they can be useful as an art direction knob to increase the amount of bounced light in the scene. Best to keep below 2 as it also causes reflections to be brighter than the scene."

#. Key:	2325390225
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ASA/Dinos/Megaraptor/Abilities/Buff_ExIsolatedDamage.UpdateGlobalDepthOfField:K2Node_SetFieldsInStruct_1.ShowPinForProperties(79).ShowPinForProperties.PropertyTooltip
#: /Game/ASA/Dinos/Megaraptor/Abilities/Buff_ExIsolatedDamage.UpdateGlobalDepthOfField:K2Node_SetFieldsInStruct_1.ShowPinForProperties(79).ShowPinForProperties.PropertyTooltip
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,2325390225"
msgid "Controls what fraction of the skylight intensity should be allowed to leak.  This can be useful as an art direction knob (non-physically based) to keep indoor areas from going fully black."
msgstr "Controls what fraction of the skylight intensity should be allowed to leak.  This can be useful as an art direction knob (non-physically based) to keep indoor areas from going fully black."

#. Key:	3979132140
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ASA/Dinos/Megaraptor/Abilities/Buff_ExIsolatedDamage.UpdateGlobalDepthOfField:K2Node_SetFieldsInStruct_1.ShowPinForProperties(8).ShowPinForProperties.PropertyTooltip
#: /Game/ASA/Dinos/Megaraptor/Abilities/Buff_ExIsolatedDamage.UpdateGlobalDepthOfField:K2Node_SetFieldsInStruct_1.ShowPinForProperties(8).ShowPinForProperties.PropertyTooltip
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,3979132140"
msgid "Control the luminance curve of the scene. Raising or lowering this value will result brightening or darkening the mid-tones of the entire image."
msgstr "Control the luminance curve of the scene. Raising or lowering this value will result brightening or darkening the mid-tones of the entire image."

