msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,1920920092"
msgid "Sets the maximum roughness value for which Lumen still traces dedicated reflection rays. Higher values improve reflection quality, but greatly increase GPU cost."
msgstr "Sets the maximum roughness value for which Lumen still traces dedicated reflection rays. Higher values improve reflection quality, but greatly increase GPU cost."

#. Key:	1342951101
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ASA/Dinos/Megaraptor/Abilities/Buff_ExIsolatedDamage.UpdateGlobalDepthOfField:K2Node_SetFieldsInStruct_1.ShowPinForProperties(91).ShowPinForProperties.PropertyTooltip
