#. Key:	4166724516
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ASA/Dinos/Megaraptor/Abilities/Buff_ExIsolatedDamage.UpdateGlobalDepthOfField:K2Node_SetFieldsInStruct_1.ShowPinForProperties(96).ShowPinForProperties.PropertyTooltip
