msgid "LOST ISLAND:\nExplore the soaring heights and hidden depths of Lost Island, featuring three powerful new creatures for you to tame. Discover jungle valleys fed by giant waterfalls, build a treehouse high in the forest canopies, get down and dirty in vast mangrove swamps, dive deep underwater, brave treacherous snowy peaks, or spelunk uncharted cave systems in search of treasure... whichever way you go, wild adventure awaits!"
