#: /Game/ASA/UI/ReMainMenu/ReHostSession_ASA.Default__ReHostSession_ASA_C.MapDescriptionsArray(15).MapDescriptionsArray.MapDescription
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,904789816"
msgid "Discover Astraeos, a colossal ARK map steeped in Greek mythology. Explore 260km² of stunning landscapes, from ancient ruins and majestic marble cliffs to blossoming cherry groves. Face powerful new enemies and tame the Maeguana, a unique, Maewing-like creature found only on Astraeos!"
msgstr "Discover Astraeos, a colossal ARK map steeped in Greek mythology. Explore 260km² of stunning landscapes, from ancient ruins and majestic marble cliffs to blossoming cherry groves. Face powerful new enemies and tame the Maeguana, a unique, Maewing-like creature found only on Astraeos!"

#. Key:	22664315
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ASA/UI/ReMainMenu/ReHostSession_ASA.Default__ReHostSession_ASA_C.MapDescriptionsArray(16).MapDescriptionsArray.MapDescription
#: /Game/ASA/UI/ReMainMenu/ReHostSession_ASA.Default__ReHostSession_ASA_C.MapDescriptionsArray(16).MapDescriptionsArray.MapDescription
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,22664315"
msgid "A desperate voice calls out to you from across the galaxy... long ago you helped her restored life to the extinct Earth, and now she needs your skills once more. She seeks the engram Codex, hidden in a lost kingdom at the end of the world: Arat Prime. Discover the dark secrets of this forlorn place as you master arcane skills, tame strange cryptofauna, cloaking yourself in powerful accursed gear. Survive its challenges & assemble an army of Thralls, as you seek to dethrone the Lost King and change the fate of the future!"
msgstr "A desperate voice calls out to you from across the galaxy... long ago you helped her restored life to the extinct Earth, and now she needs your skills once more. She seeks the engram Codex, hidden in a lost kingdom at the end of the world: Arat Prime. Discover the dark secrets of this forlorn place as you master arcane skills, tame strange cryptofauna, cloaking yourself in powerful accursed gear. Survive its challenges & assemble an army of Thralls, as you seek to dethrone the Lost King and change the fate of the future!"

