msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2784110768"
msgid "A desperate voice calls to you from across the galaxy... You once helped her restore life to the extinct Earth, and now she needs your help again. She seeks the engram Codex, hidden in a lost kingdom at the end of the world. Discover the dark secrets of this forlorn place as you master arcane skills, tame strange cryptofauna, and cloak yourself in the accursed gear of the inhabitants. Survive long enough, and you may even gather an army of Thralls as you seek to dethrone the Lost King!"
msgstr "A desperate voice calls to you from across the galaxy... You once helped her restore life to the extinct Earth, and now she needs your help again. She seeks the engram Codex, hidden in a lost kingdom at the end of the world. Discover the dark secrets of this forlorn place as you master arcane skills, tame strange cryptofauna, and cloak yourself in the accursed gear of the inhabitants. Survive long enough, and you may even gather an army of Thralls as you seek to dethrone the Lost King!"

#. Key:	1056096945
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ASA/UI/ReMainMenu/ReHostSession_ASA.Default__ReHostSession_ASA_C.MapDescriptionsArray(2).MapDescriptionsArray.MapDescription
#: /Game/ASA/UI/ReMainMenu/ReHostSession_ASA.Default__ReHostSession_ASA_C.MapDescriptionsArray(2).MapDescriptionsArray.MapDescription
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1056096945"
msgid "SCORCHED EARTH:\nPut your survival skills to the test as you find yourself stranded naked, dehydrated & starving in a vast desert. Even the most seasoned ARK survivors must quickly find water, hunt for food, harvest, craft items, and build shelter to have any chance for survival. Use skills honed on ARK's Island to kill, tame, breed, and ride the fantastical new creatures that have evolved to survive the Desert's ultra harsh conditions, including... DRAGONS!"
msgstr "SCORCHED EARTH:\nPut your survival skills to the test as you find yourself stranded naked, dehydrated & starving in a vast desert. Even the most seasoned ARK survivors must quickly find water, hunt for food, harvest, craft items, and build shelter to have any chance for survival. Use skills honed on ARK's Island to kill, tame, breed, and ride the fantastical new creatures that have evolved to survive the Desert's ultra harsh conditions, including... DRAGONS!"

