msgid "But they will boost the outpost’s power supply, and that means more energy for defenses!"
msgstr "But they will boost the outpost’s power supply, and that means more energy for defenses!"

#. Key:	1393440878
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LostColony/Characters/Helena/Voice/s_vo_helena_spawnintro.s_vo_helena_spawnintro.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.Text
