msgctxt "GraphLiteral,679778298"
msgid "I'm using that same network to communicate with you from a planet far away... "
msgstr "I'm using that same network to communicate with you from a planet far away... "

#. Key:	1062011006
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LostColony/Characters/Helena/Voice/s_vo_helena_spawnintro.s_vo_helena_spawnintro.Subtitles(3).Subtitles.Text
