msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1062011006"
msgid "...at least until the so-called Lost King figures out how I've accessed it."
msgstr "...at least until the so-called Lost King figures out how I've accessed it."

#. Key:	1445710556
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LostColony/Characters/Helena/Voice/s_vo_helena_spawnintro.s_vo_helena_spawnintro.Subtitles(4).Subtitles.Text
