msgid "Find a way in and locate the Codex, so you can transmit it across the galaxy to me here on Arat,"
msgstr "Find a way in and locate the Codex, so you can transmit it across the galaxy to me here on Arat,"

#. Key:	2998448617
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LostColony/Characters/Helena/Voice/s_vo_helena_spawnintro.s_vo_helena_spawnintro.Subtitles(7).Subtitles.Text
