msgctxt "Content,1892563919"
msgid "Only eat this dish when you intend to go into a brawl.  It causes pain and stress to your body, but grants you almost supernatural strength, speed, and resilience.\nWarning: this concoction can be habit-forming.\n\n1 serving of Raw Prime Meat\n2 handful of Mejoberries\n2 dollops of Stimulant\n2 Rare Flowers\n1 Citronal\n1 Longrass\nSubmerge in Water\nCook in a Cooking Pot"
