msgctxt "Content,4006361889"
msgid "This simple vegetarian dish refreshes your body like an oasis.  Helps keep you stay hydrated and feel cool.\n\n5 Citronal\n2 handfuls of Tintoberries\n2 handfuls of Amarberries\n1 handful of Mejoberries\n1/2 dollop of Stimulant\nSubmerge in Water\nCook in a Cooking Pot"
