#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/Items/Notes/PrimalItem_RecipeNote_Dye..ItemDescription
msgctxt "Content,1747845683"
msgid "Not only is this berry-based coloring is great for decorating cakes, it also doubles as a dye for clothing and buildings.\n\n18 Berries\nAdd 1-3 of a chemical catalyst\nSubmerge in Water\nCook in a Cooking Pot\n\nTo make different colors:\n1 - Use different berries in varying amounts\n2 - Use a different catalyst, such as Charcoal or Gunpowder"
msgstr "Not only is this berry-based coloring is great for decorating cakes, it also doubles as a dye for clothing and buildings.\n\n18 Berries\nAdd 1-3 of a chemical catalyst\nSubmerge in Water\nCook in a Cooking Pot\n\nTo make different colors:\n1 - Use different berries in varying amounts\n2 - Use a different catalyst, such as Charcoal or Gunpowder"

