msgstr "...rendering it impenetrable to the cleansing energies of the Reseed Protocol."

#. Key:	1536777313
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(38).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(38).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1536777313"
msgid "...sister facility of Sanctuary, where the technologies to store and transmit human consciousness was perfected."
msgstr "...sister facility of Sanctuary, where the technologies to store and transmit human consciousness was perfected."

#. Key:	3309117000
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(4).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(4).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3309117000"
msgid "But I did know your mom -- a long, long time ago..."
msgstr "But I did know your mom -- a long, long time ago..."

#. Key:	923732022
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(4).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(4).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,923732022"
msgid "To rule in the ruins."
msgstr "To rule in the ruins."

#. Key:	2663598795
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(40).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(40).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2663598795"
msgid "There is stored the only remaining archive of humanity's collective minds and bodies."
msgstr "There is stored the only remaining archive of humanity's collective minds and bodies."

#. Key:	2766994664
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(41).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(41).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2766994664"
msgid "The Engram Codex."
msgstr "The Engram Codex."

#. Key:	2112829062
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(42).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(42).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2112829062"
msgid "I need you to recover and transmit the Codex -- our shared heritage -- so I can use it to restore balance to my new world."
msgstr "I need you to recover and transmit the Codex -- our shared heritage -- so I can use it to restore balance to my new world."

#. Key:	4079144584
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(43).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(43).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,4079144584"
msgid "You should know that it won’t be easy, because in the thousand years After Reseeding, Arat Prime has become home to--"
msgstr "You should know that it won’t be easy, because in the thousand years After Reseeding, Arat Prime has become home to--"

#. Key:	3786062269
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(44).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(44).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3786062269"
msgid "Quick, he’s here. Brace yourself!"
msgstr "Quick, he’s here. Brace yourself!"

#. Key:	4102744826
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(45).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(45).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,4102744826"
msgid "The Codex provides a feast fit for a king and his family. And I can’t deny myself a taste."
msgstr "The Codex provides a feast fit for a king and his family. And I can’t deny myself a taste."

#. Key:	2275109833
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(46).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(46).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2275109833"
msgid "Very sweet... You are truly a marvelous creation. "
msgstr "Very sweet... You are truly a marvelous creation. "

#. Key:	2360543317
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(47).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(47).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2360543317"
msgid "I wonder... You may yet better serve the family by joining us, rather than feeding us. Yes..."
msgstr "I wonder... You may yet better serve the family by joining us, rather than feeding us. Yes..."

#. Key:	471858041
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(48).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(48).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,471858041"
msgid "You will become one of our kind."
msgstr "You will become one of our kind."

#. Key:	2314318827
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(49).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(49).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2314318827"
msgid "Drink, and you will know nothing of death or pain ever again--"
msgstr "Drink, and you will know nothing of death or pain ever again--"

#. Key:	804645442
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(5).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(5).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,804645442"
msgid "Find a way to dethrone that king, and you’ll clear the way for me to call down the ARKs, enabling Nature to be reseeded."
msgstr "Find a way to dethrone that king, and you’ll clear the way for me to call down the ARKs, enabling Nature to be reseeded."

#. Key:	979693699
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(5).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(5).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,979693699"
msgid "Diana Altaras was so brave, and fierce."
msgstr "Diana Altaras was so brave, and fierce."

#. Key:	1318501020
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(50).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(50).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1318501020"
msgid "Argh! What power is this...? Who else is in there with you?"
msgstr "Argh! What power is this...? Who else is in there with you?"

#. Key:	620743368
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(51).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(51).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,620743368"
msgid "I could only stun him for a moment."
msgstr "I could only stun him for a moment."

#. Key:	1679189301
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(52).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(52).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1679189301"
msgid "What are you waiting for, Survivor? Get the hell out of there!"
msgstr "What are you waiting for, Survivor? Get the hell out of there!"

#. Key:	1706487969
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(6).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(6).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1706487969"
msgid "Humanity and Earth’s many creatures -- and evolution itself -- can be restored!"
msgstr "Humanity and Earth’s many creatures -- and evolution itself -- can be restored!"

#. Key:	2300358818
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(6).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(6).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2300358818"
msgid "But... you’ve been with me for as long as I can remember. Guiding me..."
msgstr "But... you’ve been with me for as long as I can remember. Guiding me..."

#. Key:	3116527111
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(7).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(7).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3116527111"
msgid "In a way, you are like a daughter to me... We share memories, thoughts and feelings."
msgstr "In a way, you are like a daughter to me... We share memories, thoughts and feelings."

#. Key:	3471227890
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(7).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(7).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3471227890"
msgid "Helena Walker wanted it so. No -- I wanted it."
msgstr "Helena Walker wanted it so. No -- I wanted it."

#. Key:	1720326170
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(8).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(8).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1720326170"
msgid "I may be ‘The One Who Waits’, but I’m still Helena too."
msgstr "I may be ‘The One Who Waits’, but I’m still Helena too."

#. Key:	968256328
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(8).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(8).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,968256328"
msgid "You and I are connected to the technology of the ARKs in such a special way."
msgstr "You and I are connected to the technology of the ARKs in such a special way."

#. Key:	1621908932
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(9).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(9).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1621908932"
msgid "I remember everything now -- the struggles I faced, the losses I felt -- and the love that I found."
msgstr "I remember everything now -- the struggles I faced, the losses I felt -- and the love that I found."

#. Key:	3026084071
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(9).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(18).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(9).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3026084071"
msgid "Wait... You’re Helena Walker -- one of those heroes Dad told me about, from back on Earth!"
msgstr "Wait... You’re Helena Walker -- one of those heroes Dad told me about, from back on Earth!"

#. Key:	3316527683
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(19).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(19).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3316527683"
msgid "I should kill you for invading our refuge like this."
msgstr "I should kill you for invading our refuge like this."

#. Key:	151500400
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(19).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(1).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(19).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(1).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,151500400"
msgid "The damage you have caused will take hundreds of years to repair."
msgstr "The damage you have caused will take hundreds of years to repair."

#. Key:	3979605950
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(19).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(10).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(19).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(10).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3979605950"
msgid "All of the terrible sacrifices my people have made have been simply to live in peace, among our own."
msgstr "All of the terrible sacrifices my people have made have been simply to live in peace, among our own."

#. Key:	3090596379
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(19).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(11).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(19).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(11).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3090596379"
msgid "Show yourself, puppet master!"
msgstr "Show yourself, puppet master!"

#. Key:	3271366054
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(19).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(12).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(19).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(12).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3271366054"
msgid "No? She refuses to present herself after all? (chuckle)"
msgstr "No? She refuses to present herself after all? (chuckle)"

#. Key:	2572042262
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(19).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(14).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(19).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(14).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2572042262"
msgid "Gigadesmodus, your master beckons!"
msgstr "Gigadesmodus, your master beckons!"

#. Key:	3322497906
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(19).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(15).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(19).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(15).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3322497906"
msgid "The time for battle has arrived!"
msgstr "The time for battle has arrived!"

#. Key:	3011232587
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(19).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(16).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(19).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(16).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3011232587"
msgid "Now I am going to kill you. Show me what you’ve got!"
msgstr "Now I am going to kill you. Show me what you’ve got!"

#. Key:	2987359063
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(19).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(2).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(19).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(2).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2987359063"
msgid "But you remind me of someone from long ago, another true survivor..."
msgstr "But you remind me of someone from long ago, another true survivor..."

#. Key:	19203119
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(19).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(3).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(19).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(3).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,19203119"
msgid "Rockwell told me that she would one day seek to destroy our colony."
msgstr "Rockwell told me that she would one day seek to destroy our colony."

#. Key:	203764737
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(19).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(4).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(19).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(4).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,203764737"
msgid "So I wonder... Through some dark manipulation of our technology, does she speak through you now?"
msgstr "So I wonder... Through some dark manipulation of our technology, does she speak through you now?"

#. Key:	1027062613
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(19).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(5).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(19).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(5).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1027062613"
msgid "Tell me... what was your plan if you made it this far? Assuming this was ever your own plan at all."
msgstr "Tell me... what was your plan if you made it this far? Assuming this was ever your own plan at all."

#. Key:	1467643911
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(19).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(6).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(19).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(6).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1467643911"
msgid "Don't say anything! This has to be a trick."
msgstr "Don't say anything! This has to be a trick."

#. Key:	1216095264
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(19).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(7).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(19).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(7).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1216095264"
msgid "That force which stopped me from turning you... I was hoping you would bring her here with you..."
msgstr "That force which stopped me from turning you... I was hoping you would bring her here with you..."

#. Key:	2331070967
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(19).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(8).Subtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(19).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(8).Subtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2331070967"
msgid "That I might convince one of their kind to spare my people from the cleansing fire."
msgstr "That I might convince one of their kind to spare my people from the cleansing fire."

#. Key:	3715168100
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(19).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(9).Subtitles.BaseText
