msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3715168100"
msgid "You see, we do not wish to join their world, and with it, suffer the inevitable decay and corruption of mankind."
msgstr "You see, we do not wish to join their world, and with it, suffer the inevitable decay and corruption of mankind."

#. Key:	3629709016
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.BookendSubtitles(20).BookendSubtitles.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.BaseText
