msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2672333666"
msgid "Bob:  Now that I was the law in that forsaken outpost, I could see I was gonna have to do a bit of pest control."
msgstr "Bob:  Now that I was the law in that forsaken outpost, I could see I was gonna have to do a bit of pest control."

