#. Key:	1288278583
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(126).ExplorerNoteEntries.LocalizedSubtitle
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(126).ExplorerNoteEntries.LocalizedSubtitle
msgctxt "Content,1288278583"
msgid "The raptors are improving. They know to follow Wuzhui, and Wuzhui knows to listen to me. Beasts without riders cannot maintain a formation, but they at least run close together. In time, they have even learned how to attack and retreat at my signal during our hunts on the plains.\n\nTogether, Wuzhui and his five brothers are like a light cavalry unit, and I am their commander. Unfortunately, they are all I really have. I am not much of a craftsman, and have few possessions.\n\nNot everyone here is like me, though. There may be some who can craft but but cannot fight. Perhaps we could trade."
msgstr "The raptors are improving. They know to follow Wuzhui, and Wuzhui knows to listen to me. Beasts without riders cannot maintain a formation, but they at least run close together. In time, they have even learned how to attack and retreat at my signal during our hunts on the plains.\n\nTogether, Wuzhui and his five brothers are like a light cavalry unit, and I am their commander. Unfortunately, they are all I really have. I am not much of a craftsman, and have few possessions.\n\nNot everyone here is like me, though. There may be some who can craft but but cannot fight. Perhaps we could trade."

#. Key:	3335907961
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1260).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
