msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3418683261"
msgid "Bob:  Those two seemed real close until this pilot from the future showed up. Diana. And suddenly Helena was the odd one out."
msgstr "Bob:  Those two seemed real close until this pilot from the future showed up. Diana. And suddenly Helena was the odd one out."

#. Key:	3353306683
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1262).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
