msgstr "Meeka:  Really? Huh..."

#. Key:	3019226732
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1262).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1262).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3019226732"
msgid "Bob:  Then again, after we all got to know each other better, there was something between Diana and Santiago, too..."
msgstr "Bob:  Then again, after we all got to know each other better, there was something between Diana and Santiago, too..."

#. Key:	255987767
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1262).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
