msgctxt "GraphLiteral,255987767"
msgid "Bob:  Almost like they’d known each other before. Probably more of that ‘future’ gobbledygoop that gives me a headache."
msgstr "Bob:  Almost like they’d known each other before. Probably more of that ‘future’ gobbledygoop that gives me a headache."

#. Key:	892704961
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1262).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
