msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1674957479"
msgid "Bob:  At that point, not much else left to do -- ‘cept dig in and try to start over. But at least we wouldn’t have to do that from scratch."
msgstr "Bob:  At that point, not much else left to do -- ‘cept dig in and try to start over. But at least we wouldn’t have to do that from scratch."

#. Key:	2606797513
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1270).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1270).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
