msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1721536604"
msgid "Bob:  Now that we had set up a base camp, our little tribe of misfits realized we were gonna need a chief."
msgstr "Bob:  Now that we had set up a base camp, our little tribe of misfits realized we were gonna need a chief."

#. Key:	3937739048
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1271).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
