msgid "Bob:  Thanks, doll. But honestly, I just didn’t want the headaches that come with that job."
msgstr "Bob:  Thanks, doll. But honestly, I just didn’t want the headaches that come with that job."

#. Key:	1486033829
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1271).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
