msgstr "Bob:  Yeah well, just be glad you’re not gonna hear my ‘Helena’! "

#. Key:	3341713320
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1273).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(8).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1273).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(8).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3341713320"
msgid "Bob:  Aussies with their funny accents -- and don’t even get me started on those Kiwis, sheesh..."
msgstr "Bob:  Aussies with their funny accents -- and don’t even get me started on those Kiwis, sheesh..."

#. Key:	3658591701
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1274).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1274).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3658591701"
msgid "Bob:  Wasn’t long before your dad had a whole machine shop up and running, where he could start putting together his new toys."
msgstr "Bob:  Wasn’t long before your dad had a whole machine shop up and running, where he could start putting together his new toys."

#. Key:	2462247391
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1274).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1274).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2462247391"
msgid "Bob:  For a guy who keeps ending up in charge of people, I swear Santiago was always happiest with a welding torch in his hands."
msgstr "Bob:  For a guy who keeps ending up in charge of people, I swear Santiago was always happiest with a welding torch in his hands."

#. Key:	3787765135
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1274).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1274).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3787765135"
msgid "Meeka:  Guess I’ve never seen him happy, then."
msgstr "Meeka:  Guess I’ve never seen him happy, then."

#. Key:	743495435
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1274).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1274).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,743495435"
msgid "Bob:  Oh, now look kid -- I didn’t mean that."
msgstr "Bob:  Oh, now look kid -- I didn’t mean that."

#. Key:	4261914271
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1274).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1274).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,4261914271"
msgid "Meeka:  So what was Dad building with all that scrap you salvaged?"
msgstr "Meeka:  So what was Dad building with all that scrap you salvaged?"

#. Key:	2987114773
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1274).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1274).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2987114773"
msgid "Bob:  ‘All terrain vehicles’, he called ‘em. Low-slung four-wheelers built for speed -- and war."
msgstr "Bob:  ‘All terrain vehicles’, he called ‘em. Low-slung four-wheelers built for speed -- and war."

#. Key:	270582514
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1275).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1275).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,270582514"
msgid "Bob:  So your dad ‘n’ me left the city walls and set out across the wastes, to see what’d been falling out of the sky."
msgstr "Bob:  So your dad ‘n’ me left the city walls and set out across the wastes, to see what’d been falling out of the sky."

#. Key:	2661106243
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1275).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1275).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2661106243"
msgid "Bob:  Those jumped-up go-carts of his could really move! I mean I was hangin' on for dear life, while Santiago laughed his butt off."
msgstr "Bob:  Those jumped-up go-carts of his could really move! I mean I was hangin' on for dear life, while Santiago laughed his butt off."

#. Key:	1700888040
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1275).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1275).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1700888040"
msgid "Bob:  Lucky it was him behind the wheel though, ‘cause one of those supply drops came crashing down smack right in front of us!"
msgstr "Bob:  Lucky it was him behind the wheel though, ‘cause one of those supply drops came crashing down smack right in front of us!"

#. Key:	309350673
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1275).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1275).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,309350673"
msgid "Meeka:  Yikes."
msgstr "Meeka:  Yikes."

#. Key:	1284738626
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1275).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1275).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1284738626"
msgid "Bob:  When we tried prying the thing open, it trapped us inside some kinda force field, along with a bunch of the crazy local wildlife."
msgstr "Bob:  When we tried prying the thing open, it trapped us inside some kinda force field, along with a bunch of the crazy local wildlife."

#. Key:	2751975365
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1275).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1275).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2751975365"
msgid "Meeka:  There were still animals left alive?"
msgstr "Meeka:  There were still animals left alive?"

#. Key:	454469635
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1275).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1275).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,454469635"
msgid "Bob:  If you could call that living. Poor critters were all messed up from the poisons out in the wastes... "
msgstr "Bob:  If you could call that living. Poor critters were all messed up from the poisons out in the wastes... "

#. Key:	59738169
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1275).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1275).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,59738169"
msgid "Bob:  And they didn’t much appreciate us."
msgstr "Bob:  And they didn’t much appreciate us."

#. Key:	21073635
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1276).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1276).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,21073635"
msgid "Bob:  Wasn’t easy, but Santiago and I eventually managed to fight our way through that whole pack of freaks and open up the supply drop."
msgstr "Bob:  Wasn’t easy, but Santiago and I eventually managed to fight our way through that whole pack of freaks and open up the supply drop."

#. Key:	1326695081
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1276).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1276).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1326695081"
msgid "Bob:  Inside was enough of that Tek stuff to make your dad grin like he’d hit the jackpot. We crammed all we could fit into the trunk."
msgstr "Bob:  Inside was enough of that Tek stuff to make your dad grin like he’d hit the jackpot. We crammed all we could fit into the trunk."

#. Key:	1292842727
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1276).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1276).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1292842727"
msgid "Meeka:  You sure that was MY dad with you?"
msgstr "Meeka:  You sure that was MY dad with you?"

#. Key:	4258968760
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1276).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1276).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,4258968760"
msgid "Meeka:  Uh -- are you sure that was MY dad with you?"
msgstr "Meeka:  Uh -- are you sure that was MY dad with you?"

#. Key:	3509099802
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1276).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1276).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3509099802"
msgid "Bob:  It was him, all right. And he said we were all gonna be okay, as long as those Tek supplies keep crashing to Earth."
msgstr "Bob:  It was him, all right. And he said we were all gonna be okay, as long as those Tek supplies keep crashing to Earth."

#. Key:	2476911342
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1276).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1276).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2476911342"
msgid "Meeka:  Ya, like I said -- doesn’t sound like him."
msgstr "Meeka:  Ya, like I said -- doesn’t sound like him."

#. Key:	1144990383
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1276).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1276).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1144990383"
msgid "Bob:  But all our thoughts of long, easy lives went away real quick when we got our first look at ol’ King Titan."
msgstr "Bob:  But all our thoughts of long, easy lives went away real quick when we got our first look at ol’ King Titan."

#. Key:	220228552
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1277).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1277).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,220228552"
msgid "Bob:  Once we’d seen King Titan, we knew..."
msgstr "Bob:  Once we’d seen King Titan, we knew..."

#. Key:	713813822
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1277).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1277).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,713813822"
msgid "Bob:  People weren’t ever going to be in charge of a world with monsters of that size stomping around."
msgstr "Bob:  People weren’t ever going to be in charge of a world with monsters of that size stomping around."

#. Key:	3589581333
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1277).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1277).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3589581333"
msgid "Bob:  Your old man got his war-wagon in gear, and kept his foot on the gas until we were back inside the city walls."
msgstr "Bob:  Your old man got his war-wagon in gear, and kept his foot on the gas until we were back inside the city walls."

#. Key:	3968933435
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1277).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1277).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3968933435"
msgid "Meeka:  Must’ve been HUGE, if it scared Dad."
msgstr "Meeka:  Must’ve been HUGE, if it scared Dad."

#. Key:	4022439900
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1277).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1277).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,4022439900"
msgid "Bob:  We’d never seen anything like it. Before we got back to camp, Santiago pulled over and made me swear not to tell anyone yet."
msgstr "Bob:  We’d never seen anything like it. Before we got back to camp, Santiago pulled over and made me swear not to tell anyone yet."

#. Key:	1282648387
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1277).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1277).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1282648387"
msgid "Bob:  He wanted time to come up with a new secret weapon -- something big enough to go toe-to-toe with that Titan."
msgstr "Bob:  He wanted time to come up with a new secret weapon -- something big enough to go toe-to-toe with that Titan."

#. Key:	2333951870
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1277).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1277).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2333951870"
msgid "Bob:  I just nodded along and smiled, even though I knew we were all done-for."
msgstr "Bob:  I just nodded along and smiled, even though I knew we were all done-for."

#. Key:	799973141
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1278).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1278).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,799973141"
msgid "Bob:  Santiago picked a funny place to park and run his war plan by me on our way back to camp."
msgstr "Bob:  Santiago picked a funny place to park and run his war plan by me on our way back to camp."

#. Key:	4080291486
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1278).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1278).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,4080291486"
msgid "Bob:  I pointed out the flowers by the fountain, and told him the Beast Queen, Mei-Yin, had been leaving ‘em in memory of Diana."
msgstr "Bob:  I pointed out the flowers by the fountain, and told him the Beast Queen, Mei-Yin, had been leaving ‘em in memory of Diana."

#. Key:	4022627645
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1278).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1278).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,4022627645"
msgid "Bob:  That was when he told me he missed Diana himself, even though they’d been on opposite sides of the last world-war."
msgstr "Bob:  That was when he told me he missed Diana himself, even though they’d been on opposite sides of the last world-war."

#. Key:	4132579752
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1278).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1278).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,4132579752"
msgid "Bob:  The big guy seemed to have some real deep feelings after all."
msgstr "Bob:  The big guy seemed to have some real deep feelings after all."

#. Key:	1104695189
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1278).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1278).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1104695189"
msgid "Meeka:  Wait, he -- THEY knew each other in their first-life?"
msgstr "Meeka:  Wait, he -- THEY knew each other in their first-life?"

#. Key:	1182868739
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1278).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1278).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1182868739"
msgid "Bob:  Yeah, kid. It almost seems like some people are meant to meet up again."
msgstr "Bob:  Yeah, kid. It almost seems like some people are meant to meet up again."

#. Key:	3470254550
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1278).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1278).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3470254550"
msgid "Bob:  Been thinkin’ maybe we’re all here on this new world today for some reason like that."
msgstr "Bob:  Been thinkin’ maybe we’re all here on this new world today for some reason like that."

