msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1307510119"
msgid "Who am I? Such a simple question -- three little words. And yet, I find I am unable to summon an answer."
msgstr "Who am I? Such a simple question -- three little words. And yet, I find I am unable to summon an answer."

#. Key:	2424573257
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1291).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
