msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2424573257"
msgid "Who am I? Such a simple question –- three little words. And yet, I find I am unable to summon an answer."
msgstr "Who am I? Such a simple question –- three little words. And yet, I find I am unable to summon an answer."

#. Key:	3435849916
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1291).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1291).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3435849916"
msgid "I’ve awoken surrounded by metallic wreckage, the bright thunderclap of my arrival echoing away across a vast, rapidly-cooling crater."
msgstr "I’ve awoken surrounded by metallic wreckage, the bright thunderclap of my arrival echoing away across a vast, rapidly-cooling crater."

#. Key:	1270214548
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1291).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(10).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1291).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(10).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1270214548"
msgid "I feel myself finally slipping into nothingness, as it should be... And then..."
msgstr "I feel myself finally slipping into nothingness, as it should be... And then..."

#. Key:	3932553368
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1291).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(11).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1291).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(11).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3932553368"
msgid "No, Edmund. You won’t die here. I won’t let you."
msgstr "No, Edmund. You won’t die here. I won’t let you."

#. Key:	244094896
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1291).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(12).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1291).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(12).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,244094896"
msgid "A renewed vigor courses through me. A will to survive. And more than that... to perpetuate."
msgstr "A renewed vigor courses through me. A will to survive. And more than that... to perpetuate."

#. Key:	356375956
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1291).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(13).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1291).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(13).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,356375956"
msgid "My first goal is to escape the brutal chill. "
msgstr "My first goal is to escape the brutal chill. "

#. Key:	1284535901
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1291).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(14).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1291).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(14).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1284535901"
msgid "Somehow, I have managed to fashion a crude shelter using scavenged debris still warm from the recent impact."
msgstr "Somehow, I have managed to fashion a crude shelter using scavenged debris still warm from the recent impact."

#. Key:	3836928822
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1291).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(15).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1291).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(15).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3836928822"
msgid "Crawling inside, I curl around the vital organs at my core, desperate to raise my body temperature."
msgstr "Crawling inside, I curl around the vital organs at my core, desperate to raise my body temperature."

#. Key:	4079513476
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1291).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(16).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1291).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(16).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,4079513476"
msgid "Only then do I allow myself to slip into feverish delirium, and finally the peace of darkness -- "
msgstr "Only then do I allow myself to slip into feverish delirium, and finally the peace of darkness -- "

#. Key:	2432560248
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1291).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(17).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1291).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(17).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2432560248"
msgid "...until the nightmares begin."
msgstr "...until the nightmares begin."

#. Key:	2511621539
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1291).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1291).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2511621539"
msgid "From before this ruin, I remember little. I recall scattershot visions of monstrosity... "
msgstr "From before this ruin, I remember little. I recall scattershot visions of monstrosity... "

#. Key:	739416
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1291).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1291).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,739416"
msgid "I was something inhuman, and yet now I seem to be simply a man, vulnerable and exposed."
msgstr "I was something inhuman, and yet now I seem to be simply a man, vulnerable and exposed."

#. Key:	442682102
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1291).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1291).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,442682102"
msgid "Why that should surprise me I cannot say. "
msgstr "Why that should surprise me I cannot say. "

#. Key:	1279791733
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1291).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1291).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1279791733"
msgid "What was I before, and what am I now?"
msgstr "What was I before, and what am I now?"

#. Key:	2013008757
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1291).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1291).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2013008757"
msgid "I stumble about lost in Stygian darkness, raw flesh raked by an icy gale."
msgstr "I stumble about lost in Stygian darkness, raw flesh raked by an icy gale."

#. Key:	1530084012
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1291).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1291).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1530084012"
msgid "The stark cold jolts something loose in my mind. Betrayal... murder... madness... What had I done? "
msgstr "The stark cold jolts something loose in my mind. Betrayal... murder... madness... What had I done? "

#. Key:	780265455
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1291).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(8).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1291).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(8).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,780265455"
msgid "What had I become? A wretched being... a monster!"
msgstr "What had I become? A wretched being... a monster!"

#. Key:	1530125345
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1291).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(9).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1291).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(9).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1530125345"
msgid "I fall to my knees in the freezing wind. Better to let it end here, with some semblance of humanity intact."
msgstr "I fall to my knees in the freezing wind. Better to let it end here, with some semblance of humanity intact."

#. Key:	3983817036
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1292).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1292).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3983817036"
msgid "I can recall only shattered fragments of what came before."
msgstr "I can recall only shattered fragments of what came before."

#. Key:	2209955260
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1292).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1292).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2209955260"
msgid "In fitful bouts of sleep, enormous tentacles reach for me from a terrible abyss, "
msgstr "In fitful bouts of sleep, enormous tentacles reach for me from a terrible abyss, "

#. Key:	2095786766
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1292).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1292).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2095786766"
msgid "...spine-covered appendages lashing away pieces of my soul."
msgstr "...spine-covered appendages lashing away pieces of my soul."

#. Key:	3498793794
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1292).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1292).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3498793794"
msgid "I can almost glimpse a golden light behind it all, struggling to break through that darkness."
msgstr "I can almost glimpse a golden light behind it all, struggling to break through that darkness."

#. Key:	4244326874
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1292).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1292).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,4244326874"
msgid "But there is no daylight to separate my delusions from rationality."
msgstr "But there is no daylight to separate my delusions from rationality."

#. Key:	3427791291
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1292).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1292).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3427791291"
msgid "Scrambling about for any of the tools necessary for survival, I wonder why I cling so tightly to my sanity."
msgstr "Scrambling about for any of the tools necessary for survival, I wonder why I cling so tightly to my sanity."

#. Key:	4157590631
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1292).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1292).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,4157590631"
msgid "Surely it would be easier to simply become insensate, to let my baser instincts pilot me through this storm."
msgstr "Surely it would be easier to simply become insensate, to let my baser instincts pilot me through this storm."

#. Key:	534082021
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1292).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1292).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,534082021"
msgid "Yet I fight on to sift through the cold ashes of my memories, trying to grasp hold of the last threads tying me to the world of men."
msgstr "Yet I fight on to sift through the cold ashes of my memories, trying to grasp hold of the last threads tying me to the world of men."

#. Key:	2761346202
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1292).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(8).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1292).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(8).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2761346202"
msgid "Every scintilla of my former identity that I manage to rekindle is infinitely precious to me."
msgstr "Every scintilla of my former identity that I manage to rekindle is infinitely precious to me."

#. Key:	4191933514
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1292).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(9).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1292).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(9).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,4191933514"
msgid "That fire must be shielded from these harsh climes, and fed until it can light my way forward."
msgstr "That fire must be shielded from these harsh climes, and fed until it can light my way forward."

#. Key:	2046363572
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1293).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1293).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2046363572"
msgid "The memories arrive in waves, crashing with vivid images onto the shore of my mind, "
msgstr "The memories arrive in waves, crashing with vivid images onto the shore of my mind, "

#. Key:	3951733473
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1293).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1293).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3951733473"
msgid "...each time bringing new torments as I see my many failures laid out before me."
msgstr "...each time bringing new torments as I see my many failures laid out before me."

#. Key:	2057342901
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1293).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(10).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1293).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(10).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2057342901"
msgid "In reply, I hear only the howling wind and see the void of darkness from which it emanates."
msgstr "In reply, I hear only the howling wind and see the void of darkness from which it emanates."

#. Key:	3399744272
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1293).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(11).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1293).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(11).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3399744272"
msgid "I suppose I have my answer."
msgstr "I suppose I have my answer."

#. Key:	3538061898
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1293).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1293).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3538061898"
msgid "A life lived on a world long since dead, as a once-heralded scientist."
msgstr "A life lived on a world long since dead, as a once-heralded scientist."

#. Key:	3937572884
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1293).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1293).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3937572884"
msgid "I see a daughter I could not save. My darling little girl, my little girl. Lifeless. "
msgstr "I see a daughter I could not save. My darling little girl, my little girl. Lifeless. "

#. Key:	1570976475
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1293).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1293).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1570976475"
msgid "How I failed you, Charlotte. I failed you... Your innocent eyes will never leave me."
msgstr "How I failed you, Charlotte. I failed you... Your innocent eyes will never leave me."

#. Key:	832172345
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1293).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1293).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,832172345"
msgid "And then, a second life... on vast islands in the sky. A friend, Helena... "
msgstr "And then, a second life... on vast islands in the sky. A friend, Helena... "

#. Key:	1126100444
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1293).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1293).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1126100444"
msgid "She... cared so deeply, and understood so very much. And yet these new technologies, new possibilities... "
msgstr "She... cared so deeply, and understood so very much. And yet these new technologies, new possibilities... "

#. Key:	2521514165
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1293).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1293).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2521514165"
msgid "She cared so deeply, and understood so very much. And yet these new technologies, new possibilities... "
msgstr "She cared so deeply, and understood so very much. And yet these new technologies, new possibilities... "

#. Key:	3081428660
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1293).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1293).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3081428660"
msgid "I began to realize that the failures of my first life need not define me forever... great things were possible."
msgstr "I began to realize that the failures of my first life need not define me forever... great things were possible."

#. Key:	3758137919
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1293).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(8).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1293).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(8).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3758137919"
msgid "Yes... Remember, Edmund. You can indeed be great again. Your weakness need not be your destiny."
msgstr "Yes... Remember, Edmund. You can indeed be great again. Your weakness need not be your destiny."

#. Key:	2794149580
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1293).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(9).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1293).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(9).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2794149580"
msgid "Who are you?!"
msgstr "Who are you?!"

#. Key:	484068142
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,484068142"
msgid "As I make my way out of the wreckage, what I witness chills me far more than this unceasing, pitiless wind."
msgstr "As I make my way out of the wreckage, what I witness chills me far more than this unceasing, pitiless wind."

#. Key:	403439673
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,403439673"
msgid "Monstrosities, purple-hued revenants, shambling about, seemingly immune to these harsh climes."
msgstr "Monstrosities, purple-hued revenants, shambling about, seemingly immune to these harsh climes."

#. Key:	1126054469
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(10).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(10).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1126054469"
msgid "No, I don’t want it..."
msgstr "No, I don’t want it..."

#. Key:	2035041298
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(11).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(11).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2035041298"
msgid "You have never wanted anything more."
msgstr "You have never wanted anything more."

#. Key:	94540171
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(12).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(12).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,94540171"
msgid "Please... I can’t be that again. I can’t..."
msgstr "Please... I can’t be that again. I can’t..."

#. Key:	3908155407
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(13).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(13).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3908155407"
msgid "But you will..."
msgstr "But you will..."

#. Key:	3782767562
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(14).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(14).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3782767562"
msgid "I’m afraid..."
msgstr "I’m afraid..."

#. Key:	3415406419
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(15).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(15).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3415406419"
msgid "And that is why you will find your way back to me. Not the mortal flesh of the One, but the eternal seeds of the Many."
msgstr "And that is why you will find your way back to me. Not the mortal flesh of the One, but the eternal seeds of the Many."

#. Key:	1732977530
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(16).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(16).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1732977530"
msgid "Shutting the wretched voice away, I take my first tentative steps out of the crater."
msgstr "Shutting the wretched voice away, I take my first tentative steps out of the crater."

#. Key:	4255414800
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(17).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(17).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,4255414800"
msgid "Miraculously, the roving purple cretins do not attack. Their teeming crowds part before me, almost out of deference, as if for royalty."
msgstr "Miraculously, the roving purple cretins do not attack. Their teeming crowds part before me, almost out of deference, as if for royalty."

#. Key:	3060157884
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(18).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(18).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3060157884"
msgid "Purple pools of bubbling liquid seem to vibrate in anticipation as I hesitantly approach."
msgstr "Purple pools of bubbling liquid seem to vibrate in anticipation as I hesitantly approach."

#. Key:	1614308526
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(19).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(19).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1614308526"
msgid "I recognize... my ‘Edmundium’! Perhaps--"
msgstr "I recognize... my ‘Edmundium’! Perhaps--"

#. Key:	4091422425
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,4091422425"
msgid "They disgust me... and yet they also intrigue me. There’s something so... familiar about them..."
msgstr "They disgust me... and yet they also intrigue me. There’s something so... familiar about them..."

#. Key:	1106339275
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(20).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(20).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1106339275"
msgid "No, I must not think of it."
msgstr "No, I must not think of it."

#. Key:	3221786600
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(21).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(21).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3221786600"
msgid "But as I step over the ridgeline, I see the blood-red glow rising from the great vista beyond "
msgstr "But as I step over the ridgeline, I see the blood-red glow rising from the great vista beyond "

#. Key:	240405536
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(22).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(22).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,240405536"
msgid "...and realize at once how dangerous this place truly is."
msgstr "...and realize at once how dangerous this place truly is."

#. Key:	3810901100
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3810901100"
msgid "That’s because they are your children, Edmund."
msgstr "That’s because they are your children, Edmund."

#. Key:	3726148955
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3726148955"
msgid "My children? Charlotte was my tender child. I have no other"
msgstr "My children? Charlotte was my tender child. I have no other"

#. Key:	3921285763
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3921285763"
msgid "Don’t play coy. Surely as a ‘scientist’, you’re able to put the pieces together. I know you can."
msgstr "Don’t play coy. Surely as a ‘scientist’, you’re able to put the pieces together. I know you can."

#. Key:	3207266753
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3207266753"
msgid "What do you know about me?"
msgstr "What do you know about me?"

#. Key:	3729154625
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3729154625"
msgid "I am you, Edmund. As you really are."
msgstr "I am you, Edmund. As you really are."

#. Key:	1888796773
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(8).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(8).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1888796773"
msgid "I’m a man! Just a man... A father... a scientist... a friend..."
msgstr "I’m a man! Just a man... A father... a scientist... a friend..."

#. Key:	2366934749
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(9).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1294).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(9).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2366934749"
msgid "You are so much more than that."
msgstr "You are so much more than that."

#. Key:	539938421
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1295).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1295).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,539938421"
msgid "The source of that mysterious glow in the storm turns out to be a dystopian mockery of human civilization erupting from the ice."
msgstr "The source of that mysterious glow in the storm turns out to be a dystopian mockery of human civilization erupting from the ice."

#. Key:	157165433
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1295).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1295).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,157165433"
msgid "Its population of mindless thralls bows under the yoke of a seemingly omnipotent king."
msgstr "Its population of mindless thralls bows under the yoke of a seemingly omnipotent king."

#. Key:	2085331904
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1295).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(10).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1295).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(10).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2085331904"
msgid "...seems to act at odds with the variety I use to alter and empower my own creations."
msgstr "...seems to act at odds with the variety I use to alter and empower my own creations."

#. Key:	4268800301
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1295).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(11).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1295).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(11).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,4268800301"
msgid "It’s as if these two substances were inverse forces, one cancelling the other."
msgstr "It’s as if these two substances were inverse forces, one cancelling the other."

#. Key:	2836424915
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1295).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(12).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1295).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(12).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2836424915"
msgid "Yes, you’re beginning to understand. Now, how might you weaponize that mutual opposition?"
msgstr "Yes, you’re beginning to understand. Now, how might you weaponize that mutual opposition?"

#. Key:	4166838340
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1295).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1295).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,4166838340"
msgid "Given time, you could wield such power. Power over death... and the power to give life."
msgstr "Given time, you could wield such power. Power over death... and the power to give life."

#. Key:	265742725
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1295).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1295).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,265742725"
msgid "No, this is blasphemy made manifest."
msgstr "No, this is blasphemy made manifest."

#. Key:	2036109355
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1295).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1295).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2036109355"
msgid "These automatons offer themselves up to their demonic lord in profane ceremonies punctuated by ecstatic screams."
msgstr "These automatons offer themselves up to their demonic lord in profane ceremonies punctuated by ecstatic screams."

#. Key:	2697593250
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1295).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1295).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2697593250"
msgid "I must escape this dark dominion before I fall prey to that terrible, omnipresent will."
msgstr "I must escape this dark dominion before I fall prey to that terrible, omnipresent will."

#. Key:	2940200761
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1295).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1295).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2940200761"
msgid "Must you? This is merely another challenge for you to research and solve."
msgstr "Must you? This is merely another challenge for you to research and solve."

#. Key:	1662981314
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1295).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1295).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1662981314"
msgid "The air in this necropolis tastes like rust-- No. Blood. "
msgstr "The air in this necropolis tastes like rust-- No. Blood. "

#. Key:	2433207324
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1295).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1295).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2433207324"
msgid "The air in this necropolis tastes like rust -- No. Blood. "
msgstr "The air in this necropolis tastes like rust -- No. Blood. "

#. Key:	3732383019
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1295).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(8).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1295).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(8).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3732383019"
msgid "The toxic red phosphorescence of this place burns my bones from within."
msgstr "The toxic red phosphorescence of this place burns my bones from within."

#. Key:	3615096735
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1295).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(9).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1295).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(9).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3615096735"
msgid "The scarlet strain of Edmundium circulating through these arcane machines..."
msgstr "The scarlet strain of Edmundium circulating through these arcane machines..."

#. Key:	4065230055
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1296).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1296).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,4065230055"
msgid "The devil ruling this frozen hellscape seems to have detected my incursion of his kingdom."
msgstr "The devil ruling this frozen hellscape seems to have detected my incursion of his kingdom."

#. Key:	4064474700
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1296).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1296).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,4064474700"
msgid "But what can I do to keep his forces at bay, and how long could I hold out here at the fringes of his awareness?"
msgstr "But what can I do to keep his forces at bay, and how long could I hold out here at the fringes of his awareness?"

#. Key:	2596084008
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1296).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(10).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1296).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(10).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2596084008"
msgid "And I know that without it, I would surely die here. But if I am to heed its entreaties... "
msgstr "And I know that without it, I would surely die here. But if I am to heed its entreaties... "

#. Key:	31366771
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1296).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(11).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1296).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(11).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,31366771"
msgid "...would I follow the same path as before? Would I become that abomination once again?"
msgstr "...would I follow the same path as before? Would I become that abomination once again?"

#. Key:	2288182242
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1296).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(12).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1296).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(12).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2288182242"
msgid "Do I wish to live or to die? Should Edmund Rockwell pay for his many sins through penance, or through oblivion? "
msgstr "Do I wish to live or to die? Should Edmund Rockwell pay for his many sins through penance, or through oblivion? "

#. Key:	2973611432
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1296).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(13).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1296).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(13).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2973611432"
msgid "I breathe deeply. Then I take a step forward, and hope that this time, my defenses will hold."
msgstr "I breathe deeply. Then I take a step forward, and hope that this time, my defenses will hold."

#. Key:	4044533248
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1296).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(14).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1296).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(14).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,4044533248"
msgid "I will make them hold."
msgstr "I will make them hold."

#. Key:	345196460
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1296).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1296).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,345196460"
msgid "Confrontation is inevitable, of course. You must prepare for that..."
msgstr "Confrontation is inevitable, of course. You must prepare for that..."

#. Key:	59473178
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1296).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1296).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,59473178"
msgid "My meager stores of life-sustaining Edmundium are finite, "
msgstr "My meager stores of life-sustaining Edmundium are finite, "

#. Key:	2227834221
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1296).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1296).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2227834221"
msgid "and an impenetrable wall composed of this realm’s Red-energy makes any escape to the outside world unlikely."
msgstr "and an impenetrable wall composed of this realm’s Red-energy makes any escape to the outside world unlikely."

#. Key:	3267112964
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1296).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1296).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3267112964"
msgid "Perish any thought of retreat or surrender, Edmund! "
msgstr "Perish any thought of retreat or surrender, Edmund! "

#. Key:	2641437092
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1296).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1296).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2641437092"
msgid "Your only path to survival is to advance upon the denizens of this scarlet realm. Learn their secrets, and then take what they have."
msgstr "Your only path to survival is to advance upon the denizens of this scarlet realm. Learn their secrets, and then take what they have."

#. Key:	1586983206
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1296).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1296).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1586983206"
msgid "Use their knowledge and resources to become stronger, to expand, and to conquer. "
msgstr "Use their knowledge and resources to become stronger, to expand, and to conquer. "

#. Key:	2001945800
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1296).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(8).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1296).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(8).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2001945800"
msgid "Your ‘children’ will fight for you. Command them to advance!"
msgstr "Your ‘children’ will fight for you. Command them to advance!"

#. Key:	3596258302
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1296).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(9).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1296).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(9).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3596258302"
msgid "Hearing the wretched voice is, surprisingly, like a balm to my frayed mind."
msgstr "Hearing the wretched voice is, surprisingly, like a balm to my frayed mind."

#. Key:	526038529
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1297).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1297).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,526038529"
msgid "I woke this morning crying over my lost daughter."
msgstr "I woke this morning crying over my lost daughter."

#. Key:	3084207756
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1297).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1297).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3084207756"
msgid "Those tears still sting my eyes, as I work to conscript every local creature within reach to aid in my defense. "
msgstr "Those tears still sting my eyes, as I work to conscript every local creature within reach to aid in my defense. "

#. Key:	3752196546
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1297).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(10).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1297).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(10).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3752196546"
msgid "The Wretched Voice is right, of course. My pitiable forces won’t hold back the devil’s hordes for long."
msgstr "The Wretched Voice is right, of course. My pitiable forces won’t hold back the devil’s hordes for long."

#. Key:	3305442024
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1297).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(11).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1297).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(11).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3305442024"
msgid "But I am no mere animal to be domesticated, nor preyed upon."
msgstr "But I am no mere animal to be domesticated, nor preyed upon."

#. Key:	2401434182
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1297).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(12).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1297).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(12).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2401434182"
msgid "No animal indeed... soon you can show them what true power is."
msgstr "No animal indeed... soon you can show them what true power is."

#. Key:	3858888550
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1297).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(13).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1297).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(13).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3858888550"
msgid "Yes, they underestimate me at their peril. They all have."
msgstr "Yes, they underestimate me at their peril. They all have."

#. Key:	3993673152
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1297).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1297).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3993673152"
msgid "They bend so easily to the will of the Edmundium, just as before,"
msgstr "They bend so easily to the will of the Edmundium, just as before,"

#. Key:	1739634346
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1297).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1297).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1739634346"
msgid "...twisting into new forms as quickly as my thoughts conjure them into being."
msgstr "...twisting into new forms as quickly as my thoughts conjure them into being."

#. Key:	873013702
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1297).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1297).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,873013702"
msgid "They serve your will. They would die for their master..."
msgstr "They serve your will. They would die for their master..."

#. Key:	1898597091
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1297).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1297).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1898597091"
msgid "What -- what am I doing? I once lost my senses in a quest to bring poor Charlotte back to me."
msgstr "What -- what am I doing? I once lost my senses in a quest to bring poor Charlotte back to me."

#. Key:	863416370
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1297).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1297).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,863416370"
msgid "And then I betrayed those closest to me... I --"
msgstr "And then I betrayed those closest to me... I --"

#. Key:	3303042134
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1297).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1297).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3303042134"
msgid "The rulers of this realm are unbound by such petty moralities!"
msgstr "The rulers of this realm are unbound by such petty moralities!"

#. Key:	3789150850
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1297).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(8).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1297).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(8).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3789150850"
msgid "Do not think to confront them while you are lost in such solipsistic quivering!"
msgstr "Do not think to confront them while you are lost in such solipsistic quivering!"

#. Key:	48979124
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1297).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(9).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1297).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(9).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,48979124"
msgid "Banish all regrets, Edmund, for sentimentality accomplishes nothing."
msgstr "Banish all regrets, Edmund, for sentimentality accomplishes nothing."

#. Key:	2855067356
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2855067356"
msgid "Death wings its way toward you, even now. You can feel it out there, that hatred curdled over millennia."
msgstr "Death wings its way toward you, even now. You can feel it out there, that hatred curdled over millennia."

#. Key:	4210059833
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,4210059833"
msgid "It’s coming for you, and quickly. What will you do?"
msgstr "It’s coming for you, and quickly. What will you do?"

#. Key:	3541371605
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(10).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(10).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3541371605"
msgid "To burn away the encroaching darkness."
msgstr "To burn away the encroaching darkness."

#. Key:	2225097419
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(11).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(11).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2225097419"
msgid "At what cost?"
msgstr "At what cost?"

#. Key:	3474051155
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(12).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(12).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3474051155"
msgid "Everything. But I am here for you. I always have been."
msgstr "Everything. But I am here for you. I always have been."

#. Key:	1980668310
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(13).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(13).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1980668310"
msgid "I am the reason you survived the slums of London, when they all set upon you like a wounded dog."
msgstr "I am the reason you survived the slums of London, when they all set upon you like a wounded dog."

#. Key:	1885597542
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(14).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(14).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1885597542"
msgid "I’m the strength you used to escape predation on The Island."
msgstr "I’m the strength you used to escape predation on The Island."

#. Key:	2527421619
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(15).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(15).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2527421619"
msgid "I taught you the secrets of Edmundium in the violet caverns of that aberrant ARK."
msgstr "I taught you the secrets of Edmundium in the violet caverns of that aberrant ARK."

#. Key:	2572692211
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(16).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(16).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2572692211"
msgid "And I will save you now, if you let me in."
msgstr "And I will save you now, if you let me in."

#. Key:	727373961
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(17).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(17).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,727373961"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr "Yes."

#. Key:	785270274
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,785270274"
msgid "I do feel it -- the reaper. She is coming to claim me. What can I do? I am only one man, a weak man at that."
msgstr "I do feel it -- the reaper. She is coming to claim me. What can I do? I am only one man, a weak man at that."

#. Key:	2801093820
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2801093820"
msgid "Once you were something so much more, a billion lives within you. Do you remember the Edmundium singing in your veins, "
msgstr "Once you were something so much more, a billion lives within you. Do you remember the Edmundium singing in your veins, "

#. Key:	2055988414
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2055988414"
msgid "...how you played with the furnace of life itself, how all of creation was at your fingertips?"
msgstr "...how you played with the furnace of life itself, how all of creation was at your fingertips?"

#. Key:	3181995190
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3181995190"
msgid "I remember. So many possibilities... I could be everywhere and everything."
msgstr "I remember. So many possibilities... I could be everywhere and everything."

#. Key:	529050187
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,529050187"
msgid "But then there was so much torment. And the voices...!"
msgstr "But then there was so much torment. And the voices...!"

#. Key:	1703132523
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1703132523"
msgid "I -- I lashed out without thought... hurt allies, made mortal enemies of my friends... She -- I killed her... I did it. Oh God..."
msgstr "I -- I lashed out without thought... hurt allies, made mortal enemies of my friends... She -- I killed her... I did it. Oh God..."

#. Key:	1964247262
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1964247262"
msgid "I lashed out without thought... hurt allies, made mortal enemies of my friends... She -- I killed her... I did it. Oh God..."
msgstr "I lashed out without thought... hurt allies, made mortal enemies of my friends... She -- I killed her... I did it. Oh God..."

#. Key:	2561098905
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(8).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(8).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2561098905"
msgid "What is one life compared to the infinite possibilities of creation? "
msgstr "What is one life compared to the infinite possibilities of creation? "

#. Key:	901881616
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(9).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1298).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(9).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,901881616"
msgid "You have the means to arm yourself again with the power to defeat all of your enemies."
msgstr "You have the means to arm yourself again with the power to defeat all of your enemies."

#. Key:	1793159342
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1299).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1299).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1793159342"
msgid "The devil overlord of this realm has set his queen-enforcer on me."
msgstr "The devil overlord of this realm has set his queen-enforcer on me."

#. Key:	279197258
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1299).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1299).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,279197258"
msgid "Trust in the plan..."
msgstr "Trust in the plan..."

#. Key:	3680823882
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1299).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(10).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1299).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(10).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3680823882"
msgid "In my agonized struggle, I feel her realize -- too late -- that I’ve seeded my own lifeblood with indigo Edmundium."
msgstr "In my agonized struggle, I feel her realize -- too late -- that I’ve seeded my own lifeblood with indigo Edmundium."

#. Key:	829171460
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1299).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(11).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1299).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(11).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,829171460"
msgid "It proves... disagreeable to her own Red lifeforce."
msgstr "It proves... disagreeable to her own Red lifeforce."

#. Key:	1519732584
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1299).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(12).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1299).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(12).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1519732584"
msgid "Move and counter-move."
msgstr "Move and counter-move."

#. Key:	51837805
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1299).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(13).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1299).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(13).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,51837805"
msgid "She drops me in disgust, tries to spit out the purple poison burning her from within."
msgstr "She drops me in disgust, tries to spit out the purple poison burning her from within."

#. Key:	2558995058
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1299).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(14).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1299).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(14).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2558995058"
msgid "As I hasten to staunch my bleeding, I watch the demon queen take to the sky in a desperate attempt to fly back to her master,"
msgstr "As I hasten to staunch my bleeding, I watch the demon queen take to the sky in a desperate attempt to fly back to her master,"

#. Key:	905157669
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1299).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(15).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1299).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(15).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,905157669"
msgid "...her erratic movement signaling her blighted state."
msgstr "...her erratic movement signaling her blighted state."

#. Key:	3100526081
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1299).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(16).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1299).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(16).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3100526081"
msgid "Check, ‘Your Majesty’."
msgstr "Check, ‘Your Majesty’."

#. Key:	4246807789
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1299).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1299).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,4246807789"
msgid "She is a fearsome vision in unholy armor, menace incarnate -- an impossibly tall, winged Valkyrie."
msgstr "She is a fearsome vision in unholy armor, menace incarnate -- an impossibly tall, winged Valkyrie."

#. Key:	3807480351
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1299).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1299).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3807480351"
msgid "Why does her relentless, bloodthirsty determination remind me of someone I once knew?"
msgstr "Why does her relentless, bloodthirsty determination remind me of someone I once knew?"

#. Key:	2832058016
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1299).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1299).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2832058016"
msgid "Pawns to Queen."
msgstr "Pawns to Queen."

#. Key:	3715735676
