#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1300).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(9).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
