msgctxt "GraphLiteral,721221199"
msgid "It’s hard to fully accept what we here at Arat Prime have accomplished together, arguably the most momentous and audacious thing ever attempted by human ingenuity."
msgstr "It’s hard to fully accept what we here at Arat Prime have accomplished together, arguably the most momentous and audacious thing ever attempted by human ingenuity."

#. Key:	1622471024
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1301).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
