msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1622471024"
msgid "Though the mission took all of our remaining resources, everyone that ever lived on Earth now has a chance to survive and prosper elsewhere in the cosmos, thanks to our work."
msgstr "Though the mission took all of our remaining resources, everyone that ever lived on Earth now has a chance to survive and prosper elsewhere in the cosmos, thanks to our work."

#. Key:	3481438055
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1301).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
