msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1608054846"
msgid "Perhaps those same descendants will even find a way to forgive us for fouling our homeworld beyond repair."
msgstr "Perhaps those same descendants will even find a way to forgive us for fouling our homeworld beyond repair."

#. Key:	1101330680
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1301).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
