msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1101330680"
msgid "But for now, my team -- my people’s thoughts are with the brave crew of the Genesis ship as they search the heavens for a new home for humanity."
msgstr "But for now, my team -- my people’s thoughts are with the brave crew of the Genesis ship as they search the heavens for a new home for humanity."

