#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1302).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1063786640"
msgid "...a limitation of the system’s design, the creators can not themselves be created."
msgstr "...a limitation of the system’s design, the creators can not themselves be created."

#. Key:	594265678
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1302).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1302).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,594265678"
msgid "As long as this facility stays operational, we can continue to store other creatures’ new memories and experiences into the Engram Codex,"
msgstr "As long as this facility stays operational, we can continue to store other creatures’ new memories and experiences into the Engram Codex,"

#. Key:	20803530
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1302).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1302).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,20803530"
msgid "...and upload them across our transluminal communication link with the Genesis seed ship."
msgstr "...and upload them across our transluminal communication link with the Genesis seed ship."

#. Key:	2467712437
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1302).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1302).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2467712437"
msgid "A person could close their eyes here and then awake to open their eyes on an alien world in the distant future, with no sense of lost continuity."
msgstr "A person could close their eyes here and then awake to open their eyes on an alien world in the distant future, with no sense of lost continuity."

#. Key:	4280739573
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1302).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1302).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,4280739573"
msgid "That is, someone other than us."
msgstr "That is, someone other than us."

#. Key:	1888370223
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1302).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(8).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1302).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(8).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1888370223"
msgid "But we -- who labored for generations to preserve the biological riches of planet Earth -- "
msgstr "But we -- who labored for generations to preserve the biological riches of planet Earth -- "

#. Key:	3806299035
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1302).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(9).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1302).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(9).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3806299035"
msgid "...we shall not get to see the results of our efforts."
msgstr "...we shall not get to see the results of our efforts."

#. Key:	1336707358
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1303).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1303).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1336707358"
msgid "Scouts have definitively confirmed that long-term survival is impossible in the outside world."
msgstr "Scouts have definitively confirmed that long-term survival is impossible in the outside world."

#. Key:	448065547
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1303).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1303).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,448065547"
msgid "Our isolation and shielding have kept us hidden from the Titans laying waste to the rest of the world, but we are unlikely to endure much longer here."
msgstr "Our isolation and shielding have kept us hidden from the Titans laying waste to the rest of the world, but we are unlikely to endure much longer here."

#. Key:	74926860
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1303).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1303).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,74926860"
msgid "Nor can we expect any intervention by our ascended cousins -- the so-called ‘Homo deus’ -- now that they’ve abandoned us to play in their orbital ARKs."
msgstr "Nor can we expect any intervention by our ascended cousins -- the so-called ‘Homo deus’ -- now that they’ve abandoned us to play in their orbital ARKs."

#. Key:	844544250
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1303).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1303).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,844544250"
msgid "Our technology helped make it possible, and yet they have abandoned us too. But there must be a way forward."
msgstr "Our technology helped make it possible, and yet they have abandoned us too. But there must be a way forward."

#. Key:	1374152373
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1303).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1303).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1374152373"
msgid "I was entrusted to lead this last bastion of humanity, and I refuse to just wait around for my people to starve in the dark."
msgstr "I was entrusted to lead this last bastion of humanity, and I refuse to just wait around for my people to starve in the dark."

#. Key:	3298867151
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1303).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1303).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3298867151"
msgid "No... we will not go quietly into the night."
msgstr "No... we will not go quietly into the night."

#. Key:	61822733
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1303).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1303).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,61822733"
msgid "Given the collective engineering and scientific expertise we possess, I’m determined to make survival our new mission."
msgstr "Given the collective engineering and scientific expertise we possess, I’m determined to make survival our new mission."

#. Key:	2846519597
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1303).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1303).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2846519597"
msgid "We will find a way to outlast this."
msgstr "We will find a way to outlast this."

#. Key:	512175005
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1303).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1303).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,512175005"
msgid "I won’t fail my people, we will find a way to outlast this."
msgstr "I won’t fail my people, we will find a way to outlast this."

#. Key:	971487433
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1304).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1304).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,971487433"
msgid "After years of extreme power conservation and enforced austerity measures, we may have found a solution to our dwindling fuel supply."
msgstr "After years of extreme power conservation and enforced austerity measures, we may have found a solution to our dwindling fuel supply."

#. Key:	1591752194
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1304).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1304).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1591752194"
msgid "A novel red isotope of the exotic Element powering our civilization has been discovered inside our borders, deep under the Antarctic ice."
msgstr "A novel red isotope of the exotic Element powering our civilization has been discovered inside our borders, deep under the Antarctic ice."

#. Key:	759559145
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1304).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1304).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,759559145"
msgid "Unlike the blue variant, which provides immense energy, and the purple variant, which creates carbon-based life, the Red Element seems to have unique properties."
msgstr "Unlike the blue variant, which provides immense energy, and the purple variant, which creates carbon-based life, the Red Element seems to have unique properties."

#. Key:	2929411520
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1304).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1304).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2929411520"
msgid "This new Red Element will let us keep the heat on and our energy shielding up, once we finish doing some creative re-imagining of our infrastructure."
msgstr "This new Red Element will let us keep the heat on and our energy shielding up, once we finish doing some creative re-imagining of our infrastructure."

#. Key:	2403192110
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1304).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1304).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2403192110"
msgid "But Red Element is not comparable in power output to the blue substance, and so the environmental pressures on our closed system of agriculture remain an ongoing threat."
msgstr "But Red Element is not comparable in power output to the blue substance, and so the environmental pressures on our closed system of agriculture remain an ongoing threat."

#. Key:	122981244
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1304).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1304).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,122981244"
msgid "Since our world stopped turning altogether, it’s becoming increasingly difficult to feed our animals and ourselves."
msgstr "Since our world stopped turning altogether, it’s becoming increasingly difficult to feed our animals and ourselves."

#. Key:	3522714779
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1304).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1304).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3522714779"
msgid "Faced with endless darkness, I’m forced to consider more radical options. I will consult with my colleagues."
msgstr "Faced with endless darkness, I’m forced to consider more radical options. I will consult with my colleagues."

#. Key:	1484385680
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1305).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1305).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1484385680"
msgid "There may be a solution to our crisis, albeit one almost too horrible to contemplate."
msgstr "There may be a solution to our crisis, albeit one almost too horrible to contemplate."

#. Key:	3999881909
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1305).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1305).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3999881909"
msgid "Experimentation on animal and human subjects with exposure to Red Element has demonstrated an unexpected potential to boost longevity."
msgstr "Experimentation on animal and human subjects with exposure to Red Element has demonstrated an unexpected potential to boost longevity."

#. Key:	554414393
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1305).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1305).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,554414393"
msgid "Experimentation on animal and human subjects with exposure to Red Element has demonstrated an unexpected potential to boost longevity, potentially indefinitely."
msgstr "Experimentation on animal and human subjects with exposure to Red Element has demonstrated an unexpected potential to boost longevity, potentially indefinitely."

#. Key:	2565736173
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1305).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1305).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2565736173"
msgid "Better still, the isotope can bond with human hemoglobin to produce a new and more efficient type of biofuel."
msgstr "Better still, the isotope can bond with human hemoglobin to produce a new and more efficient type of biofuel."

#. Key:	746744351
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1305).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1305).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,746744351"
msgid "Provided our society can overcome its collective squeamishness over biomodification, it’s within our reach to engineer a new future for our people."
msgstr "Provided our society can overcome its collective squeamishness over biomodification, it’s within our reach to engineer a new future for our people."

#. Key:	1810895479
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1305).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1305).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1810895479"
msgid "Borrowing the cryotolerance of Antarctic sea life and the metabolism of hematophagous creatures like vampire bats and leeches,"
msgstr "Borrowing the cryotolerance of Antarctic sea life and the metabolism of hematophagous creatures like vampire bats and leeches,"

#. Key:	1017470350
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1305).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1305).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1017470350"
msgid "...we could shrug off the cold and open up a new source of bioavailable energy."
msgstr "...we could shrug off the cold and open up a new source of bioavailable energy."

#. Key:	628098914
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1305).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1305).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,628098914"
msgid "Because we just so happen to have an endless clone bank of potential blood donors at our disposal... "
msgstr "Because we just so happen to have an endless clone bank of potential blood donors at our disposal... "

#. Key:	2656934479
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1305).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1305).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2656934479"
msgid "The Codex can provide life itself."
msgstr "The Codex can provide life itself."

#. Key:	234955554
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1306).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1306).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,234955554"
msgid "There was predictable opposition to my admittedly radical proposal."
msgstr "There was predictable opposition to my admittedly radical proposal."

#. Key:	1067717274
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1306).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1306).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1067717274"
msgid "Revulsion at the idea of exploiting our precious Codex was only to be expected in a community of such devout humanists."
msgstr "Revulsion at the idea of exploiting our precious Codex was only to be expected in a community of such devout humanists."

#. Key:	195670471
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1306).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1306).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,195670471"
msgid "Revulsion at the idea of exploiting the precious Codex was only to be expected in a community of such devout humanists."
msgstr "Revulsion at the idea of exploiting the precious Codex was only to be expected in a community of such devout humanists."

#. Key:	3092512300
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1306).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(10).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1306).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(10).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3092512300"
msgid "Those who can see that this is the only path will be part of our new colony. Those who cannot... can provide sustenance."
msgstr "Those who can see that this is the only path will be part of our new colony. Those who cannot... can provide sustenance."

#. Key:	966538685
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1306).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(11).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1306).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(11).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,966538685"
msgid "The Rubicon has been crossed, and so we are lost... We are the Lost... there is no other way forward."
msgstr "The Rubicon has been crossed, and so we are lost... We are the Lost... there is no other way forward."

#. Key:	2696783458
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1306).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1306).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2696783458"
msgid "Why could they not see the choice before us: adaptation, or death?"
msgstr "Why could they not see the choice before us: adaptation, or death?"

#. Key:	1640486570
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1306).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1306).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1640486570"
msgid "Why should everything that we are, all we have come to know and learn and love --"
msgstr "Why should everything that we are, all we have come to know and learn and love --"

#. Key:	3411060821
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1306).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1306).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3411060821"
msgid "Why should everything that we are, all we have come to know and learn and love -– "
msgstr "Why should everything that we are, all we have come to know and learn and love -– "

#. Key:	282688492
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1306).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1306).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,282688492"
msgid "...why should that vanish into oblivion when we possess the power to live forever?"
msgstr "...why should that vanish into oblivion when we possess the power to live forever?"

#. Key:	3952880854
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1306).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1306).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3952880854"
msgid "Many objected to the heretical mutations I believe necessary to the continued survival of our colony."
msgstr "Many objected to the heretical mutations I believe necessary to the continued survival of our colony."

#. Key:	375282548
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1306).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1306).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,375282548"
msgid "Regrettably, their resistance will have to be put down for the greater good."
msgstr "Regrettably, their resistance will have to be put down for the greater good."

#. Key:	1394998759
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1306).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1306).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1394998759"
msgid "It’s not as if I am demanding the sacrifice of ensouled cognizant people to feed our colony."
msgstr "It’s not as if I am demanding the sacrifice of ensouled cognizant people to feed our colony."

#. Key:	3093133014
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1306).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(8).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1306).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(8).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3093133014"
msgid "These liminal meat-puppets will exist only to serve as buffer hosts, that can transubstantiate an environmental toxin into a life-giving miracle substance."
msgstr "These liminal meat-puppets will exist only to serve as buffer hosts, that can transubstantiate an environmental toxin into a life-giving miracle substance."

#. Key:	2003844694
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1306).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(9).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1306).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(9).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2003844694"
msgid "The Red will deliver us from starvation and open up a new age of post-humanity on our otherwise extinct homeworld."
msgstr "The Red will deliver us from starvation and open up a new age of post-humanity on our otherwise extinct homeworld."

#. Key:	670201443
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1307).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1307).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,670201443"
msgid "Faced with an existential threat to our continued life on this Earth, I was forced to seize supreme executive power in order to implement my solution."
msgstr "Faced with an existential threat to our continued life on this Earth, I was forced to seize supreme executive power in order to implement my solution."

#. Key:	2066726725
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1307).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1307).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2066726725"
msgid "The Turning of our people has begun."
msgstr "The Turning of our people has begun."

#. Key:	3764506835
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1307).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1307).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3764506835"
msgid "Now begins a period of great chaos, as my bioengineered enforcers seek out any dissidents remaining within our borders..."
msgstr "Now begins a period of great chaos, as my bioengineered enforcers seek out any dissidents remaining within our borders..."

#. Key:	333308206
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1307).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1307).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,333308206"
msgid "...and enforce compliance one way or another."
msgstr "...and enforce compliance one way or another."

#. Key:	1594557614
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1307).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1307).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1594557614"
msgid "So many friends and colleagues are now gone, but they could not face the necessity of what had to be done."
msgstr "So many friends and colleagues are now gone, but they could not face the necessity of what had to be done."

#. Key:	3292596056
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1307).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1307).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3292596056"
msgid "This new way of life has only come about due to my conviction , my willpower."
msgstr "This new way of life has only come about due to my conviction , my willpower."

#. Key:	448435250
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1307).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1307).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,448435250"
msgid "This new way of life has only come about due to my conviction and willpower."
msgstr "This new way of life has only come about due to my conviction and willpower."

#. Key:	54414805
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1307).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1307).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,54414805"
msgid "So it seemed reasonable to stack the deck in my own favor by giving myself the most profound genetic upgrades."
msgstr "So it seemed reasonable to stack the deck in my own favor by giving myself the most profound genetic upgrades."

#. Key:	2245048766
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1307).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1307).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2245048766"
msgid "After all... a people need a leader. And their leader must be strong."
msgstr "After all... a people need a leader. And their leader must be strong."

#. Key:	3678152084
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1308).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1308).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3678152084"
msgid "At long last and through great sacrifice, a kind of equilibrium has finally been achieved."
msgstr "At long last and through great sacrifice, a kind of equilibrium has finally been achieved."

#. Key:	3535987165
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1308).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1308).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3535987165"
msgid "Our people will live on in the endless night, no thanks to those who abandoned us to our fate once we launched them toward their bright future."
msgstr "Our people will live on in the endless night, no thanks to those who abandoned us to our fate once we launched them toward their bright future."

#. Key:	1968100756
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1308).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1308).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1968100756"
msgid "If and when the colonists on the seed ship find a habitable new world, the plan was to call their new home Arat."
msgstr "If and when the colonists on the seed ship find a habitable new world, the plan was to call their new home Arat."

#. Key:	3126545662
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1308).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1308).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3126545662"
msgid "But Earth was the cradle of humanity, and Arat Prime remains its last terrestrial outpost."
msgstr "But Earth was the cradle of humanity, and Arat Prime remains its last terrestrial outpost."

#. Key:	301186056
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1308).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1308).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,301186056"
msgid "We will carry the torch on into the long night."
msgstr "We will carry the torch on into the long night."

#. Key:	1259285333
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1308).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1308).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1259285333"
msgid "Down here in the darkness, we may not be able to thrive as they will in their sunlit new world, but I have seen to it that we will endure."
msgstr "Down here in the darkness, we may not be able to thrive as they will in their sunlit new world, but I have seen to it that we will endure."

#. Key:	3125216854
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1308).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1308).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3125216854"
msgid "It only seems fair that the clones they left behind will serve to feed us into perpetuity."
msgstr "It only seems fair that the clones they left behind will serve to feed us into perpetuity."

#. Key:	3326834359
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1309).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1309).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3326834359"
msgid "So much time has passed without anything to challenge the order of my kingdom, that I was slow to react to a surprising new threat."
msgstr "So much time has passed without anything to challenge the order of my kingdom, that I was slow to react to a surprising new threat."

#. Key:	3816881968
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1309).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1309).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3816881968"
msgid "So much time had passed without anything to challenge the order of my kingdom, that I was slow to react to a surprising new threat."
msgstr "So much time had passed without anything to challenge the order of my kingdom, that I was slow to react to a surprising new threat."

#. Key:	215301266
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1309).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1309).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,215301266"
msgid "An outsider found her way into my realm, and she is formidable indeed."
msgstr "An outsider found her way into my realm, and she is formidable indeed."

#. Key:	1244765859
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1309).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1309).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1244765859"
msgid "Li-Meiyin has systematically slain nearly all of the remaining challengers to my throne that I had placed in her way."
msgstr "Li-Meiyin has systematically slain nearly all of the remaining challengers to my throne that I had placed in her way."

#. Key:	195428129
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1309).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
