msgctxt "GraphLiteral,195428129"
msgid "Li-Meiyin has systematically slain nearly all of the remaining challengers to my throne that I placed in her way."
msgstr "Li-Meiyin has systematically slain nearly all of the remaining challengers to my throne that I placed in her way."

#. Key:	3490667327
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1309).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1309).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3490667327"
msgid "She appears to be the clone of an ancient warrior who originated on one of the ARKs built by those others, so long ago."
msgstr "She appears to be the clone of an ancient warrior who originated on one of the ARKs built by those others, so long ago."

#. Key:	480548975
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1309).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1309).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,480548975"
msgid "Why does she seem so single-mindedly determined to find my Codex?"
msgstr "Why does she seem so single-mindedly determined to find my Codex?"

#. Key:	3270106943
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1309).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1309).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3270106943"
msgid "I must access the records of the ARK network to learn all I can about this remarkable woman, and how she came to be here."
msgstr "I must access the records of the ARK network to learn all I can about this remarkable woman, and how she came to be here."

#. Key:	2396160114
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1309).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1309).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2396160114"
msgid "What drives the unyielding fire that I sense in her? And how could it yet benefit my Kingdom?"
msgstr "What drives the unyielding fire that I sense in her? And how could it yet benefit my Kingdom?"

#. Key:	2397530846
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1309).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1309).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2397530846"
msgid "What drives the unyielding fire that I sense in her? And could it yet benefit the Kingdom?"
msgstr "What drives the unyielding fire that I sense in her? And could it yet benefit the Kingdom?"

#. Key:	643538446
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(131).ExplorerNoteEntries.LocalizedSubtitle
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(131).ExplorerNoteEntries.LocalizedSubtitle
msgctxt "Content,643538446"
msgid "Entry 6\nIt did not take long for me to grow accustomed to the weapons of this world – many of which are called \"guns\" according to one of my lieutenants. They are far more accurate and deadly than any bow, but like any weapon, they are only as effective as their wielder. In the hands of the Blackthumbs, they are of no concern.\n\nIn battle, we have been able to bait the Blackthumbs into attacking a wave of durable but disposable beasts before descending upon them with our main force. Our attacks are concentrated while theirs are scattered. That makes all the difference.\n\nGaius Marcellus Nerva\nVictoria per Disciplinam"
msgstr "Entry 6\nIt did not take long for me to grow accustomed to the weapons of this world – many of which are called \"guns\" according to one of my lieutenants. They are far more accurate and deadly than any bow, but like any weapon, they are only as effective as their wielder. In the hands of the Blackthumbs, they are of no concern.\n\nIn battle, we have been able to bait the Blackthumbs into attacking a wave of durable but disposable beasts before descending upon them with our main force. Our attacks are concentrated while theirs are scattered. That makes all the difference.\n\nGaius Marcellus Nerva\nVictoria per Disciplinam"

#. Key:	1004243037
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1310).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1310).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1004243037"
msgid "Meiyin may have submitted to the Turning, but she remains my queen-consort in name only."
msgstr "Meiyin may have submitted to the Turning, but she remains my queen-consort in name only."

#. Key:	1954889424
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1310).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
