msgid "In the centuries since, she has proved to be my most effective enforcer, "
msgstr "In the centuries since, she has proved to be my most effective enforcer, "

#. Key:	3336545261
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1310).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(10).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
