msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3336545261"
msgid "I expect those negotiations will be brief."
msgstr "I expect those negotiations will be brief."

#. Key:	1791760347
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1310).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(11).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1310).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(11).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1791760347"
msgid "These are the private logs of Darius Anthem, the director of the Arat Prime facility."
msgstr "These are the private logs of Darius Anthem, the director of the Arat Prime facility."

#. Key:	3004902192
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1310).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(12).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1310).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(12).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3004902192"
msgid "I hope in better times they will serve as a record of what has transpired here... and what may yet come to be"
msgstr "I hope in better times they will serve as a record of what has transpired here... and what may yet come to be"

#. Key:	486934817
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1310).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1310).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,486934817"
msgid "...killing the last of the warlords who sought to overthrow me, leaving my rule absolute."
msgstr "...killing the last of the warlords who sought to overthrow me, leaving my rule absolute."

#. Key:	3407798576
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1310).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1310).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3407798576"
msgid "Yet she keeps her distance, holding back her innermost thoughts."
msgstr "Yet she keeps her distance, holding back her innermost thoughts."

#. Key:	1405274413
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1310).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1310).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1405274413"
msgid "I could force her to my will, but that would crush my last hope of true companionship."
msgstr "I could force her to my will, but that would crush my last hope of true companionship."

#. Key:	3447566338
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1310).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1310).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3447566338"
msgid "Most recently, another outsider adversary has arrived on our doorstep, as it happens, someone from my queen’s second life on the ARKs."
msgstr "Most recently, another outsider adversary has arrived on our doorstep, as it happens, someone from my queen’s second life on the ARKs."

#. Key:	929438779
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1310).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1310).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,929438779"
msgid "This clever interloper has begun to corrupt the borders of my kingdom..."
msgstr "This clever interloper has begun to corrupt the borders of my kingdom..."

#. Key:	532647953
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1310).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1310).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,532647953"
msgid "with mutated wildlife, and reanimated thrall corpses he evidently intends to set against us."
msgstr "with mutated wildlife, and reanimated thrall corpses he evidently intends to set against us."

#. Key:	3310951642
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1310).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(8).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1310).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(8).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3310951642"
msgid "This invader amuses me."
msgstr "This invader amuses me."

#. Key:	2005844488
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1310).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(9).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1310).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(9).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2005844488"
msgid "I will leave it to my Lost Queen to negotiate with her one-time fellow traveler, this ‘Edmund Rockwell’."
msgstr "I will leave it to my Lost Queen to negotiate with her one-time fellow traveler, this ‘Edmund Rockwell’."

#. Key:	4149932800
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1311).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1311).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,4149932800"
msgid "Ha! Never crossed our minds to try to ride one of those freaky creatures."
msgstr "Ha! Never crossed our minds to try to ride one of those freaky creatures."

#. Key:	4170396142
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1311).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1311).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,4170396142"
msgid "Audio Archive Request:  <<Meiyin  Li>>\r\nCross-reference:  <<Diana Altaras>>\r\n\r\n <<Meiyin and Diana Altaras>> Archival Audio 001\r\n\r\nThe following conversation took place on the aberrant ARK, directly after a first encounter between Diana and Meiyin.\r\n\r\nMeiyin was riding a tame aberrant theropod at the time of this encounter.\r\n\r\nThe small squad led by Diana was clad in makeshift TEK armor and armed with TEK weaponry."
msgstr "Audio Archive Request:  <<Meiyin  Li>>\r\nCross-reference:  <<Diana Altaras>>\r\n\r\n <<Meiyin and Diana Altaras>> Archival Audio 001\r\n\r\nThe following conversation took place on the aberrant ARK, directly after a first encounter between Diana and Meiyin.\r\n\r\nMeiyin was riding a tame aberrant theropod at the time of this encounter.\r\n\r\nThe small squad led by Diana was clad in makeshift TEK armor and armed with TEK weaponry."

#. Key:	1375334951
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1311).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1311).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1375334951"
msgid "But you seem to have a special way with dangerous animals."
msgstr "But you seem to have a special way with dangerous animals."

#. Key:	2311497041
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1311).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(10).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1311).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(10).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2311497041"
msgid "A very kind offer... My name is Meiyin."
msgstr "A very kind offer... My name is Meiyin."

#. Key:	2005290859
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1311).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(11).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1311).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(11).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2005290859"
msgid "Diana. And listen, you’re free to come or go, whenever you want."
msgstr "Diana. And listen, you’re free to come or go, whenever you want."

#. Key:	4247061504
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1311).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(12).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1311).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(12).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,4247061504"
msgid "But I think we’d be stronger together."
msgstr "But I think we’d be stronger together."

#. Key:	1134467579
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1311).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(13).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1311).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(13).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1134467579"
msgid "And who knows, I might just grow on ya."
msgstr "And who knows, I might just grow on ya."

#. Key:	1559873623
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1311).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1311).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1559873623"
msgid "And your armor is like nothing I have ever seen."
msgstr "And your armor is like nothing I have ever seen."

#. Key:	400166272
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1311).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1311).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,400166272"
msgid "I was unsure you were like me, underneath it all."
msgstr "I was unsure you were like me, underneath it all."

#. Key:	422451932
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1311).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1311).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,422451932"
msgid "I don’t know that there’s anyone like you."
msgstr "I don’t know that there’s anyone like you."

#. Key:	4142159035
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1311).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1311).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,4142159035"
msgid "How have you managed to survive down here without Tek?"
msgstr "How have you managed to survive down here without Tek?"

#. Key:	3310858375
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1311).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1311).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3310858375"
msgid "Are there more of you?"
msgstr "Are there more of you?"

#. Key:	1931396212
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1311).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1311).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1931396212"
msgid "There were others. But we were... separated."
msgstr "There were others. But we were... separated."

#. Key:	2425542863
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1311).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(8).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1311).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(8).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2425542863"
msgid "You should ride with us, then. "
msgstr "You should ride with us, then. "

#. Key:	1702908166
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1311).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(9).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1311).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(9).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1702908166"
msgid "Feels like we could learn a lot from each other."
msgstr "Feels like we could learn a lot from each other."

#. Key:	1200778426
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1312).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1312).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1200778426"
msgid "Was it your people that built these... ARKs?"
msgstr "Was it your people that built these... ARKs?"

#. Key:	1286031233
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1312).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1312).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1286031233"
msgid " <<Meiyin and Diana Altaras>> Archival Audio 002\r\n\r\nThe following conversation took place on the aberrant ARK, shortly after Diana made contact with Meiyin."
msgstr " <<Meiyin and Diana Altaras>> Archival Audio 002\r\n\r\nThe following conversation took place on the aberrant ARK, shortly after Diana made contact with Meiyin."

#. Key:	3924469416
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1312).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1312).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3924469416"
msgid "No way! We’re just a bunch of grunts."
msgstr "No way! We’re just a bunch of grunts."

#. Key:	1128901075
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1312).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(10).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1312).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(10).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1128901075"
msgid "And I can show you the basics."
msgstr "And I can show you the basics."

#. Key:	3726142902
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1312).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(11).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1312).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(11).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3726142902"
msgid "I would like that."
msgstr "I would like that."

#. Key:	1422641817
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1312).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1312).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1422641817"
msgid "Oh, right -- you’re not from the 22nd century... We’re soldiers."
msgstr "Oh, right -- you’re not from the 22nd century... We’re soldiers."

#. Key:	773325034
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1312).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1312).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,773325034"
msgid "So we are all strangers lost in these tunnels..."
msgstr "So we are all strangers lost in these tunnels..."

#. Key:	3464795055
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1312).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1312).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3464795055"
msgid "You’re right that all of this seems artificial."
msgstr "You’re right that all of this seems artificial."

#. Key:	1358702379
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1312).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1312).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1358702379"
msgid "But whoever made it... they’re way beyond us."
msgstr "But whoever made it... they’re way beyond us."

#. Key:	1618954033
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1312).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1312).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1618954033"
msgid "You people, your-- ‘Tek’... Is all far beyond me."
msgstr "You people, your-- ‘Tek’... Is all far beyond me."

#. Key:	2693386180
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1312).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1312).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2693386180"
msgid "Oh, I don’t know about that. You seem quick to adapt."
msgstr "Oh, I don’t know about that. You seem quick to adapt."

#. Key:	2794408334
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1312).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
