msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2755184442"
msgid "Look, how ‘bout we set you up with some of our gear, back at camp?"
msgstr "Look, how ‘bout we set you up with some of our gear, back at camp?"

#. Key:	2667230962
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1313).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
