msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1313850683"
msgid "And I will master the art of those-- what did you call them?"
msgstr "And I will master the art of those-- what did you call them?"

#. Key:	2138222222
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1313).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(14).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1313).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(14).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2138222222"
msgid "Jetpacks?"
msgstr "Jetpacks?"

#. Key:	2013349374
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1313).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(15).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1313).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(15).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2013349374"
msgid "‘Jet-packs’."
msgstr "‘Jet-packs’."

#. Key:	1693921304
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1313).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(16).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1313).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(16).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1693921304"
msgid "But first, I think we both need a break."
msgstr "But first, I think we both need a break."

#. Key:	3689934181
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1313).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(17).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1313).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(17).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3689934181"
msgid "I will cook us a stew with these small creatures I’ve caught."
msgstr "I will cook us a stew with these small creatures I’ve caught."

#. Key:	2604665100
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1313).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(18).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1313).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(18).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2604665100"
msgid "Mmm, you do know the way to a lady’s heart."
msgstr "Mmm, you do know the way to a lady’s heart."

#. Key:	1111026618
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1313).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1313).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1111026618"
msgid "Thanks, but we're lucky to have his Tek expertise..."
msgstr "Thanks, but we're lucky to have his Tek expertise..."

#. Key:	1137793158
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1313).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1313).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1137793158"
msgid "Santiago knows his way around that junk better than anyone."
msgstr "Santiago knows his way around that junk better than anyone."

#. Key:	4282073747
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1313).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1313).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,4282073747"
msgid "That said, he and I were once on opposite sides in the war..."
msgstr "That said, he and I were once on opposite sides in the war..."

#. Key:	4080833952
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1313).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1313).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,4080833952"
msgid "Time was, I would’ve dropped that guy on sight. Pa-choo!"
msgstr "Time was, I would’ve dropped that guy on sight. Pa-choo!"

#. Key:	1347164295
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1313).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1313).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1347164295"
msgid "Seems that times change. Hearts, too..."
msgstr "Seems that times change. Hearts, too..."

#. Key:	1656995351
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1313).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1313).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1656995351"
msgid "Happens when you save someone's life, and they save yours."
msgstr "Happens when you save someone's life, and they save yours."

#. Key:	505122071
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1313).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(8).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1313).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(8).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,505122071"
msgid "That sounds like a challenge."
msgstr "That sounds like a challenge."

#. Key:	716267868
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1313).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(9).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1313).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(9).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,716267868"
msgid "What you hear is me asking you to stick around. Keep at it."
msgstr "What you hear is me asking you to stick around. Keep at it."

#. Key:	218742674
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1314).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1314).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,218742674"
msgid "Would’ve thought you’d be happier to see your friends again."
msgstr "Would’ve thought you’d be happier to see your friends again."

#. Key:	569984526
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1314).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
