msgctxt "GraphLiteral,569984526"
msgid "<<Meiyin and Diana Altaras>> Archival Audio 004\r\nCross-Reference: <<Helena Walker>>\r\n\r\nThe following conversation took place just after Helena was reunited with Meiyin on the Aberrant ARK."
msgstr "<<Meiyin and Diana Altaras>> Archival Audio 004\r\nCross-Reference: <<Helena Walker>>\r\n\r\nThe following conversation took place just after Helena was reunited with Meiyin on the Aberrant ARK."

#. Key:	3354692089
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1314).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1314).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3354692089"
msgid "Okay, maybe not the creepy old guy..."
msgstr "Okay, maybe not the creepy old guy..."

#. Key:	451981929
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1314).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(10).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1314).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(10).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,451981929"
msgid "Whatever you decide, we’re gonna be okay."
msgstr "Whatever you decide, we’re gonna be okay."

#. Key:	1476617594
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1314).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1314).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1476617594"
msgid "I never expected to see Helena again. We were... very close."
msgstr "I never expected to see Helena again. We were... very close."

#. Key:	136971719
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1314).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1314).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(3).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,136971719"
msgid "Oh yeah? Close? Like you and I close?"
msgstr "Oh yeah? Close? Like you and I close?"

#. Key:	2469674216
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1314).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1314).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(4).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2469674216"
msgid "Yes. Though she and I knew each other longer..."
msgstr "Yes. Though she and I knew each other longer..."

#. Key:	3625584833
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1314).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1314).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(5).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3625584833"
msgid "Mei, I’m a big girl."
msgstr "Mei, I’m a big girl."

#. Key:	2674430120
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1314).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1314).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2674430120"
msgid "I won’t stand between the two of you... if that’s what you want."
msgstr "I won’t stand between the two of you... if that’s what you want."

#. Key:	3837733537
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1314).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1314).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3837733537"
msgid "Before she and I found each other, I believed I was fated to be alone..."
msgstr "Before she and I found each other, I believed I was fated to be alone..."

#. Key:	3633589580
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1314).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(8).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1314).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(8).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3633589580"
msgid "Aw, hey. She must be really special, to make you hurt like this."
msgstr "Aw, hey. She must be really special, to make you hurt like this."

#. Key:	975795562
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1314).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(9).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1314).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(9).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,975795562"
msgid "You both have meant very much to me..."
msgstr "You both have meant very much to me..."

#. Key:	1792720047
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1315).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1315).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
