msgid "<<Meiyin and Diana Altaras>> Archival Audio 005\r\nCross-Reference: <<Edmund Rockwell>>\r\n\r\nThe following conversation took place twenty one hours before Diana was killed by Rockwell on the Aberrant ARK."
msgstr "<<Meiyin and Diana Altaras>> Archival Audio 005\r\nCross-Reference: <<Edmund Rockwell>>\r\n\r\nThe following conversation took place twenty one hours before Diana was killed by Rockwell on the Aberrant ARK."

#. Key:	1958437421
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1315).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
