msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1958437421"
msgid "Your old flame took to our battle armor faster than any recruit I can remember."
msgstr "Your old flame took to our battle armor faster than any recruit I can remember."

#. Key:	645878096
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1315).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
