msgid "Ask me anything. Unless you plan to bring up that cloning idea again..."
msgstr "Ask me anything. Unless you plan to bring up that cloning idea again..."

#. Key:	3512206411
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1317).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
