msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3512206411"
msgid "No, not that. It’s just... are you hearing them too? Those voices..."
msgstr "No, not that. It’s just... are you hearing them too? Those voices..."

#. Key:	1536739636
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1317).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(8).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
