msgid "No, but this dead world is sure to be haunted..."
msgstr "No, but this dead world is sure to be haunted..."

#. Key:	4256604976
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1317).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(9).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
