msgstr "<<Meiyin and Helena Walker>> Archival Audio 008\r\nCross-Reference: <<Santiago Da Costa>>\r\n\r\nThe following conversation took place after Meiyin and Helena had first been evaluated by Santiago as potential Mek pilots on the Extinct Earth."

#. Key:	3419226472
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1318).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
