msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3419226472"
msgid "What do I have to do to convince you? Sing it for you?"
msgstr "What do I have to do to convince you? Sing it for you?"

#. Key:	3517180247
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1318).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(10).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
