msgid "Maybe a little overdramatic."
msgstr "Maybe a little overdramatic."

#. Key:	3121276226
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1318).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1318).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3121276226"
msgid "Look, Meiyin, setting aside my ‘sync rating’ -- whatever that is -- "
