#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1318).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1318).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(7).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1636536137"
msgid "...you’re his top candidate! Trust me."
msgstr "...you’re his top candidate! Trust me."

