msgid "<<Meiyin and Helena Walker>> Archival Audio 009\r\n\r\nThe following conversation took place on the Extinct Earth, after Helena touched the prism Meiyin recovered from an abandoned facility."
msgstr "<<Meiyin and Helena Walker>> Archival Audio 009\r\n\r\nThe following conversation took place on the Extinct Earth, after Helena touched the prism Meiyin recovered from an abandoned facility."

#. Key:	48342233
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1319).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1319).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(0).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,48342233"
msgid "I told you that gem was dangerous. Are you all right?"
msgstr "I told you that gem was dangerous. Are you all right?"

