#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1319).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1319).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3908873919"
msgid "It... spoke to me. I finally know what I have to do."
msgstr "It... spoke to me. I finally know what I have to do."

#. Key:	311962327
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1319).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(10).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1319).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(10).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,311962327"
msgid "What the hell kind of destiny is that?"
msgstr "What the hell kind of destiny is that?"

#. Key:	2442694743
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1319).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(11).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1319).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(11).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2442694743"
msgid "I don’t know. But it’s not death, Meiyin. It's..."
msgstr "I don’t know. But it’s not death, Meiyin. It's..."

#. Key:	1626339393
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1319).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(12).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1319).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(12).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1626339393"
msgid "It’s not life either -- not exactly."
msgstr "It’s not life either -- not exactly."

#. Key:	629368014
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1319).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(13).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1319).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(13).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,629368014"
msgid "More like... existing in a state at one with the Universe,"
msgstr "More like... existing in a state at one with the Universe,"

#. Key:	3484204918
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1319).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(14).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1319).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(14).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3484204918"
msgid "...outside our bounds of time and space."
msgstr "...outside our bounds of time and space."

#. Key:	2304091904
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1319).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(15).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1319).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(15).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2304091904"
msgid "I think from there, I can cross over to the time when Earth can truly be healed,"
msgstr "I think from there, I can cross over to the time when Earth can truly be healed,"

#. Key:	3219995262
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1319).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(16).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1319).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(16).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3219995262"
msgid "...and make sure it happens."
msgstr "...and make sure it happens."

#. Key:	1606484566
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1319).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(17).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1319).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(17).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1606484566"
msgid "And why should you have to pay for their mistakes?"
msgstr "And why should you have to pay for their mistakes?"

#. Key:	1111228617
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1319).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(18).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1319).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(18).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1111228617"
msgid "Haven’t we both sacrificed enough already? Isn’t there some other way?"
msgstr "Haven’t we both sacrificed enough already? Isn’t there some other way?"

#. Key:	1588479127
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1319).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(19).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1319).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(19).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1588479127"
msgid "I wish there was."
msgstr "I wish there was."

#. Key:	3986519389
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1319).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1319).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(2).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3986519389"
msgid "What I am meant to do. But I don’t know if I can..."
