#. Key:	341339557
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1321).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(22).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1321).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(22).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,341339557"
msgid "...for survival in this unforgiving place."
msgstr "...for survival in this unforgiving place."

#. Key:	1317566551
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1321).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(23).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
