msgid "<<Lost King Darius I and Edmund Rockwell>> Archival Audio 002\r\nCross-Reference:  <<Lost Queen>>\r\n\r\nThe following conversation took place in the Reception Chamber of the Royal Palace atop Arat Prime, as the Lost King returned to confront Rockwell after tending to the stricken Lost Queen."
msgstr "<<Lost King Darius I and Edmund Rockwell>> Archival Audio 002\r\nCross-Reference:  <<Lost Queen>>\r\n\r\nThe following conversation took place in the Reception Chamber of the Royal Palace atop Arat Prime, as the Lost King returned to confront Rockwell after tending to the stricken Lost Queen."

#. Key:	880754966
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1322).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1322).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,880754966"
msgid "Tell me, how fares the Queen?"
msgstr "Tell me, how fares the Queen?"

#. Key:	3400208996
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1322).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(10).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1322).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(10).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3400208996"
msgid "...she’ll soon hear the voices -- my voices."
