msgid "...as a man of science, this is all there is."
msgstr "...as a man of science, this is all there is."

#. Key:	4000102717
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1323).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(53).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
