msgid "At long last, I’d finally achieved a kind of order here."
msgstr "At long last, I’d finally achieved a kind of order here."

#. Key:	2704777572
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1323).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(55).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
