msgid "...the ARKs triggered their cleansing fires, ‘healing the world’."
msgstr "...the ARKs triggered their cleansing fires, ‘healing the world’."

#. Key:	822705536
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1323).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(57).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
