msgstr "...this being of light that tears us apart..."

#. Key:	2245776319
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1323).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(6).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
