msgid "<<Lost King Darius I and Edmund Rockwell>> Archival Audio 004\r\nCross-Reference:  <<Lost Queen>>\r\n\r\nThe following conversation took place in the Reception Chamber of the Royal Palace atop Arat Prime, after Rockwell had been devising a cure for the Lost Queen's contamination."
msgstr "<<Lost King Darius I and Edmund Rockwell>> Archival Audio 004\r\nCross-Reference:  <<Lost Queen>>\r\n\r\nThe following conversation took place in the Reception Chamber of the Royal Palace atop Arat Prime, after Rockwell had been devising a cure for the Lost Queen's contamination."

#. Key:	3100087770
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1324).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1324).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(1).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,3100087770"
msgid "No more stalling, Doctor."
msgstr "No more stalling, Doctor."

#. Key:	4233225825
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1324).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(10).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
