msgctxt "GraphLiteral,264179279"
msgid "...and as I cannot leave this place without being destroyed by the so-called cleansing fire,"
msgstr "...and as I cannot leave this place without being destroyed by the so-called cleansing fire,"

#. Key:	1280222794
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1324).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(12).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
