#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1324).ExplorerNoteEntries.BinkMediaSubtitles(15).BinkMediaSubtitles.BaseText
