#. Key:	2136251779
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1326).ExplorerNoteEntries.LocalizedSubtitle
#: /Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1326).ExplorerNoteEntries.LocalizedSubtitle
msgctxt "GraphLiteral,2136251779"
msgid "Common Name: Ossidon\r\nSpecies: Cryopithecus Dominus\r\nTime: Necrocene\r\nDiet: Carnivore\r\nTemperament: Relentless\r\n\r\nOverview\r\nProject Ossidon has already yielded the ideal apex protector for our people! Experimentation with Red Element infusion of creatures engineered for hardiness has given us a truly fearsome anthropoid that can dominate the Antarctic wastes. \r\n\r\nNote Information\r\nBy design, these noble snow-beasts can be sorted at a distance by adaption. Each specimen morphologically expresses its most useful genomic trait. The healthiest Ossidon will grow largest, while the deadliest will flash the longest claws.\r\n\r\nApplications\r\nBiotech teams are laboring around the clock to gestate and domesticate as many Ossidons as possible, for the day they may be needed to keep a Titan at bay. In the near term, these glorious behemoths will be employed as our peacekeepers and guardians.\r\n\r\nVisual Attachment\r\nOssidon was engineered to produce excessive quantities of cryogenic mucus. This foul substance is the creature's greatest weapon, whether rolled into an icy wrecking ball or spit in a shower of bone-chilling slush.\r\n\r\nAny rider will feel unstoppable astride one of these imposing brutes! Our mounted forces will soon become as integral to the defense of this outpost as our shielding."
msgstr "Common Name: Ossidon\r\nSpecies: Cryopithecus Dominus\r\nTime: Necrocene\r\nDiet: Carnivore\r\nTemperament: Relentless\r\n\r\nOverview\r\nProject Ossidon has already yielded the ideal apex protector for our people! Experimentation with Red Element infusion of creatures engineered for hardiness has given us a truly fearsome anthropoid that can dominate the Antarctic wastes. \r\n\r\nNote Information\r\nBy design, these noble snow-beasts can be sorted at a distance by adaption. Each specimen morphologically expresses its most useful genomic trait. The healthiest Ossidon will grow largest, while the deadliest will flash the longest claws.\r\n\r\nApplications\r\nBiotech teams are laboring around the clock to gestate and domesticate as many Ossidons as possible, for the day they may be needed to keep a Titan at bay. In the near term, these glorious behemoths will be employed as our peacekeepers and guardians.\r\n\r\nVisual Attachment\r\nOssidon was engineered to produce excessive quantities of cryogenic mucus. This foul substance is the creature's greatest weapon, whether rolled into an icy wrecking ball or spit in a shower of bone-chilling slush.\r\n\r\nAny rider will feel unstoppable astride one of these imposing brutes! Our mounted forces will soon become as integral to the defense of this outpost as our shielding."

