msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1613885087"
msgid "Common Name: Veilwyn\r\nSpecies: Vulpes frigus\r\nTime: Necrocene\r\nDiet: Omnivore\r\nTemperament: Affectionately Playful\r\n\r\nOverview\r\nThe Turning of our people has gifted us with longevity, great strength, and freedom from starvation. Maintaining the loyalty of our thralls and the obedience of the clones they police for us may require something more than brute intimidation. To this end, I find myself weighing the potential of mutated local wildlife like the Veilwyn. In these early days of our kingdom, an animal companion capable of comforting and protecting our people through the long Antarctic night might also have an inspirational value.\r\n\r\nApplications\r\nThis playful vulpine beast has many unlikely but uncannily useful talents. One can't help but admire a Veilwyn's ability to generate localized wormholes through which to summon a pack of friends that will help protect its master. And even in more peaceful times, these seemingly friendly foxes could subdue would-be predators with their cryogenic bite.\r\n\r\nI may consider pairing my most trusted servants with Veilwyn companions. Perhaps even a thrall deserves the unwavering fidelity of a valiant familiar. This creature could yet become the symbol of my benevolence that elicits the veneration of my vassals. And in this dark tomorrow, their unwavering devotion could serve to remind us all of the humanity we had to set aside in order to survive.\r\n"
msgstr "Common Name: Veilwyn\r\nSpecies: Vulpes frigus\r\nTime: Necrocene\r\nDiet: Omnivore\r\nTemperament: Affectionately Playful\r\n\r\nOverview\r\nThe Turning of our people has gifted us with longevity, great strength, and freedom from starvation. Maintaining the loyalty of our thralls and the obedience of the clones they police for us may require something more than brute intimidation. To this end, I find myself weighing the potential of mutated local wildlife like the Veilwyn. In these early days of our kingdom, an animal companion capable of comforting and protecting our people through the long Antarctic night might also have an inspirational value.\r\n\r\nApplications\r\nThis playful vulpine beast has many unlikely but uncannily useful talents. One can't help but admire a Veilwyn's ability to generate localized wormholes through which to summon a pack of friends that will help protect its master. And even in more peaceful times, these seemingly friendly foxes could subdue would-be predators with their cryogenic bite.\r\n\r\nI may consider pairing my most trusted servants with Veilwyn companions. Perhaps even a thrall deserves the unwavering fidelity of a valiant familiar. This creature could yet become the symbol of my benevolence that elicits the veneration of my vassals. And in this dark tomorrow, their unwavering devotion could serve to remind us all of the humanity we had to set aside in order to survive.\r\n"

#. Key:	1298530203
