msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1298530203"
msgid "Common Name: Solwyn\r\nSpecies: Vulpes angelicus \r\nTime: Necrocene\r\nDiet: Omnivore\r\nTemperament: Resolutely protective\r\n\r\nOverview\r\nOne of our geologists discovered a potentially-exploitable new mineral resource while surveying the perimeter for veins of Element. Some of this novel substance -- which she named ‘Vulpite’ -- was ingested by her mutant companion before she could stop it. Her juvenile Veilwyn underwent an unexpected metamorphosis during its next teleportation, increasing in mass, muscle density, and cognitive response.\r\nWith its strength, speed, and extraordinary abilities enhanced by Vulpite, this once-diminutive pet can now carry a rider across the Antarctic wastes at great speed. We decided to call her majestic new mount a Solwyn.\r\n\r\nApplications\r\nAny young Veilwyn fed enough Vulpite will become a Solwyn. This miraculous fox-mount protects its rider from the ravages of our environment, as they speed together across glacial terrain, up sheer ice cliffs, and through frigid polar waters. \r\n\r\nA Solwyn can use its cryokinesis to create fragile ice-bridges or project sharp ice shards. Its ability to generate localized wormholes allows the creature to tuck itself into a quantum hideaway for later retrieval. The Solwyn’s Vulpite-enhanced system gives it greatly increased strength, healing factor, and velocity.\r\n\r\nSuch uncanny traversal abilities and portability would seem to make the Solywn an ideal mount for scouting applications. Best of all, a Solwyn's drive to protect its bonded Thrall has also expanded, making it more than a match for any modestly-sized threat to its rider.\r\n"
msgstr "Common Name: Solwyn\r\nSpecies: Vulpes angelicus \r\nTime: Necrocene\r\nDiet: Omnivore\r\nTemperament: Resolutely protective\r\n\r\nOverview\r\nOne of our geologists discovered a potentially-exploitable new mineral resource while surveying the perimeter for veins of Element. Some of this novel substance -- which she named ‘Vulpite’ -- was ingested by her mutant companion before she could stop it. Her juvenile Veilwyn underwent an unexpected metamorphosis during its next teleportation, increasing in mass, muscle density, and cognitive response.\r\nWith its strength, speed, and extraordinary abilities enhanced by Vulpite, this once-diminutive pet can now carry a rider across the Antarctic wastes at great speed. We decided to call her majestic new mount a Solwyn.\r\n\r\nApplications\r\nAny young Veilwyn fed enough Vulpite will become a Solwyn. This miraculous fox-mount protects its rider from the ravages of our environment, as they speed together across glacial terrain, up sheer ice cliffs, and through frigid polar waters. \r\n\r\nA Solwyn can use its cryokinesis to create fragile ice-bridges or project sharp ice shards. Its ability to generate localized wormholes allows the creature to tuck itself into a quantum hideaway for later retrieval. The Solwyn’s Vulpite-enhanced system gives it greatly increased strength, healing factor, and velocity.\r\n\r\nSuch uncanny traversal abilities and portability would seem to make the Solywn an ideal mount for scouting applications. Best of all, a Solwyn's drive to protect its bonded Thrall has also expanded, making it more than a match for any modestly-sized threat to its rider.\r\n"

#. Key:	1309002674
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1333).ExplorerNoteEntries.LocalizedSubtitle
