msgctxt "GraphLiteral,1309002674"
msgid "Common Name: Gigadesmodus\r\nSpecies: Gigadesmodus regius\r\nTime: Necrocene\r\nDiet: Carnivore\r\nTemperament: Ruthlessly Aggressive\r\n\r\nOverview\r\nOur gene-forges have at long last delivered a singular regal mount worthy of my esteem! Gigadesmodus is a truly intimidating chiropteran steed unparalleled in history or legend. This mighty colossus will earn the respect and awe of all who see it winging across the skies above our kingdom.\r\n\r\nApplications\r\nIn war-readiness, Gigadesmodus surpasses every measure. That fearsome strength means it can easily carry my mobile command center on its back while hauling any behemoth high above a battlefield. Echolocation allows Gigadesmodus to navigate in complete darkness, and its nocturnal aggression fuels a relentless pursuit of my enemies. \r\n\r\nIf any challenge to my authority were to arise, they would have little hope of overcoming the ferocious creature’s combat prowess. I’ve altered the metabolism of Gigadesmodus to promote rapid healing with every bite it delivers, and to share its regenerative power with me.\r\n\r\nGigadesmodus carries a reservoir of consumed blood mixed with Red Element that can deal with my enemies at a significant distance. And in the event an example must be made, the beast’s sharp tail can be employed to deliver a devastating finishing blow.\r\n\r\nI am truly delighted with this living emblem of my enduring majesty! Long shall we reign.\r\n"
msgstr "Common Name: Gigadesmodus\r\nSpecies: Gigadesmodus regius\r\nTime: Necrocene\r\nDiet: Carnivore\r\nTemperament: Ruthlessly Aggressive\r\n\r\nOverview\r\nOur gene-forges have at long last delivered a singular regal mount worthy of my esteem! Gigadesmodus is a truly intimidating chiropteran steed unparalleled in history or legend. This mighty colossus will earn the respect and awe of all who see it winging across the skies above our kingdom.\r\n\r\nApplications\r\nIn war-readiness, Gigadesmodus surpasses every measure. That fearsome strength means it can easily carry my mobile command center on its back while hauling any behemoth high above a battlefield. Echolocation allows Gigadesmodus to navigate in complete darkness, and its nocturnal aggression fuels a relentless pursuit of my enemies. \r\n\r\nIf any challenge to my authority were to arise, they would have little hope of overcoming the ferocious creature’s combat prowess. I’ve altered the metabolism of Gigadesmodus to promote rapid healing with every bite it delivers, and to share its regenerative power with me.\r\n\r\nGigadesmodus carries a reservoir of consumed blood mixed with Red Element that can deal with my enemies at a significant distance. And in the event an example must be made, the beast’s sharp tail can be employed to deliver a devastating finishing blow.\r\n\r\nI am truly delighted with this living emblem of my enduring majesty! Long shall we reign.\r\n"

#. Key:	194739721
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/PrimalEarth/CoreBlueprints/PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP.Default__PrimalGameDataARKNX_BP_C.ExplorerNoteEntries(1334).ExplorerNoteEntries.LocalizedSubtitle
