msgid "Common Name: Thrall\r\nSpecies: Homo servilis\r\nTime: Necrocene\r\nDiet: Sanguinovore\r\nTemperament: Eternally Obedient\r\n\r\nOverview\r\nRegrettably I must impose a rigid and clear social hierarchy to ensure our ongoing survival. There must be a clear division of status in our kingdom between the citizenry and our vast underclass of worker drones. Still, we must recognize and reward the best of our clones, for the greater good.\r\n\r\nWe have already had to accept the harsh reality that our labor force must also serve as our food source… But we will need a class of loyal taskmasters to oversee their efforts, while also ensuring they continue to share their precious lifeblood on demand. Perhaps we could make a ceremony of that process, thereby celebrating their contribution to the ongoing survival of our people.\r\n\r\nApplications\r\nCertain of our worker stock have proven themselves loyal and worthy of promotion. These select few thralls can be trusted with a modicum of our bioengineered power to help them maintain order. Supervision of the enthralled can be assured via remote connection with their neural centers, making it possible to assert control of their higher functions if necessary.  While our thralls keep the peace, we can turn our attention to larger threats inside and outside the kingdom.\r\n"
msgstr "Common Name: Thrall\r\nSpecies: Homo servilis\r\nTime: Necrocene\r\nDiet: Sanguinovore\r\nTemperament: Eternally Obedient\r\n\r\nOverview\r\nRegrettably I must impose a rigid and clear social hierarchy to ensure our ongoing survival. There must be a clear division of status in our kingdom between the citizenry and our vast underclass of worker drones. Still, we must recognize and reward the best of our clones, for the greater good.\r\n\r\nWe have already had to accept the harsh reality that our labor force must also serve as our food source… But we will need a class of loyal taskmasters to oversee their efforts, while also ensuring they continue to share their precious lifeblood on demand. Perhaps we could make a ceremony of that process, thereby celebrating their contribution to the ongoing survival of our people.\r\n\r\nApplications\r\nCertain of our worker stock have proven themselves loyal and worthy of promotion. These select few thralls can be trusted with a modicum of our bioengineered power to help them maintain order. Supervision of the enthralled can be assured via remote connection with their neural centers, making it possible to assert control of their higher functions if necessary.  While our thralls keep the peace, we can turn our attention to larger threats inside and outside the kingdom.\r\n"

