msgctxt "Content,3446076242"
msgid "Ice Titan\n\nThus ends the reign of the Lord of Winter. Its freezing breath, icy spears and colossal leaps had felled so many, but on this day, the giant of wind and rime was at last brought low - all by your hand."
msgstr "Ice Titan\n\nThus ends the reign of the Lord of Winter. Its freezing breath, icy spears and colossal leaps had felled so many, but on this day, the giant of wind and rime was at last brought low - all by your hand."

